(2451516, 338159, 59390, '<td valign="top">This image speaks a thousand words. In a sad way, you captured this man''s failure - whether that is good or bad.</td>', 'This image speaks a thousand words. In a sad way, you captured this man''s failure - whether that is good or bad.', '2006-05-24 01:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451518, 337511, 59390, '<td valign="top">i see nothing . .</td>', 'i see nothing . .', '2006-05-24 01:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451520, 338306, 59390, '<td valign="top">Image is too small, and I don''t grasp a feeling of "failure" from it</td>', 'Image is too small, and I don''t grasp a feeling of "failure" from it', '2006-05-24 01:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451528, 337947, 59390, '<td valign="top">Wow..., what a great photo! The model, the dress, the cash. It speaks ill fortune. The photo is 10 for me.</td>', 'Wow..., what a great photo! The model, the dress, the cash. It speaks ill fortune. The photo is 10 for me.', '2006-05-24 01:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451532, 338126, 16241, '<td valign="top">good!</td>', 'good!', '2006-05-24 01:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451547, 337995, 18197, '<td valign="top">Please make your submitted images bigger. I''d like to see the detail.</td>', 'Please make your submitted images bigger. I''d like to see the detail.', '2006-05-24 01:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451553, 338241, 21714, '<td valign="top">Man! You need to drink more water!</td>', 'Man! You need to drink more water!', '2006-05-24 01:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451558, 338306, 18197, '<td valign="top">Please submit larger images. I''d like to see the detail.</td>', 'Please submit larger images. I''d like to see the detail.', '2006-05-24 01:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451567, 337948, 15643, '<td valign="top">For What?</td>', 'For What?', '2006-05-24 01:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451578, 337428, 39429, '<td valign="top">Interesting action and nice catch on the spray.  I''d love to see a level horizon and more color in the sky.  Good start and some post processing would even make it stronger.</td>', 'Interesting action and nice catch on the spray.  I''d love to see a level horizon and more color in the sky.  Good start and some post processing would even make it stronger.', '2006-05-24 01:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451579, 337920, 57202, '<td valign="top">While this photo is certainly contemplative, I''m not 100% sure if it fits the theme of Failure.  The composition is very nice though. :)</td>', 'While this photo is certainly contemplative, I''m not 100% sure if it fits the theme of Failure.  The composition is very nice though. :)', '2006-05-24 01:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451582, 335706, 57202, '<td valign="top">Amazing textures...</td>', 'Amazing textures...', '2006-05-24 01:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451585, 337532, 39429, '<td valign="top">You''ve really caught the action here.  The jpeg artifacts are so strong that it takes away from the image.</td>', 'You''ve really caught the action here.  The jpeg artifacts are so strong that it takes away from the image.', '2006-05-24 01:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451588, 337832, 57202, '<td valign="top">Where does "failure" come in?</td>', 'Where does "failure" come in?', '2006-05-24 01:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451590, 337130, 39429, '<td valign="top">I missed this.  I''m not sure what it is.  Interesting background, though.</td>', 'I missed this.  I''m not sure what it is.  Interesting background, though.', '2006-05-24 01:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451591, 337013, 57202, '<td valign="top">I really like the bright clouds and the rich tones of the water and sand. :)</td>', 'I really like the bright clouds and the rich tones of the water and sand. :)', '2006-05-24 01:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451595, 338285, 57202, '<td valign="top">Why is this "failure"?</td>', 'Why is this "failure"?', '2006-05-24 01:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451600, 337820, 39429, '<td valign="top">Even with the title, I find this hard to understand.  I find it interesting in an abstract way, with a definite area of focus.</td>', 'Even with the title, I find this hard to understand.  I find it interesting in an abstract way, with a definite area of focus.', '2006-05-24 01:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451603, 336771, 57202, '<td valign="top">I do really like this shot, but it is distracting to see the photographer and tripod reflected in the dryer door.</td>', 'I do really like this shot, but it is distracting to see the photographer and tripod reflected in the dryer door.', '2006-05-24 01:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451609, 337972, 36371, '<td valign="top">Wonderful catch! 10</td>', 'Wonderful catch! 10', '2006-05-24 01:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451612, 336891, 57202, '<td valign="top">Ooo, I thought about trying to shoot around that title, but never came up with anything good.  Glad to see the theme put to great use! :)  I love the shallow DOF.</td>', 'Ooo, I thought about trying to shoot around that title, but never came up with anything good.  Glad to see the theme put to great use! :)  I love the shallow DOF.', '2006-05-24 01:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451615, 337314, 39429, '<td valign="top">The technicals on this shot are nice, however the image itself is not very interesting.  It would be nice to have some new socks. ;-)</td>', 'The technicals on this shot are nice, however the image itself is not very interesting.  It would be nice to have some new socks. ;-)', '2006-05-24 01:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451619, 338034, 39429, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting.  I really like this chess shot.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting.  I really like this chess shot.', '2006-05-24 01:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451622, 337883, 57202, '<td valign="top">It seems a bit blurry and grainy to me.  I like the colors, but wish I could see the loneliness on her face in greater detail.</td>', 'It seems a bit blurry and grainy to me.  I like the colors, but wish I could see the loneliness on her face in greater detail.', '2006-05-24 01:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451623, 337999, 39429, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sillouette.  I like the way you''ve been able to connect great beauty to failure.</td>', 'Beautiful sillouette.  I like the way you''ve been able to connect great beauty to failure.', '2006-05-24 01:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451625, 337314, 36371, '<td valign="top">That''s just too strange looking....</td>', 'That''s just too strange looking....', '2006-05-24 01:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451626, 337614, 57202, '<td valign="top">I like the tight focus, but the light used seems a little harsh to me.</td>', 'I like the tight focus, but the light used seems a little harsh to me.', '2006-05-24 01:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451628, 336891, 36371, '<td valign="top">I hope you found this broken, but since it looks newly broken I doubt it...<br/>Good colors tho.</td>', 'I hope you found this broken, but since it looks newly broken I doubt it...Good colors tho.', '2006-05-24 01:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451634, 337841, 57202, '<td valign="top">I get why this should represent failure, but wish we could see the batter''s face to make sure that we can see the failure in his face.  From this angle, it''s not 100% clear if he has struck out or not.</td>', 'I get why this should represent failure, but wish we could see the batter''s face to make sure that we can see the failure in his face.  From this angle, it''s not 100% clear if he has struck out or not.', '2006-05-24 02:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451635, 337841, 39429, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic shot here.  The body language says fail so well.  You''ve done an excellent job on your crop and composition.</td>', 'Very dramatic shot here.  The body language says fail so well.  You''ve done an excellent job on your crop and composition.', '2006-05-24 02:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451637, 338306, 57202, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. :)  However, it would have been a bit better for me if it had been sized to the full 640 px width.</td>', 'I really like this shot. :)  However, it would have been a bit better for me if it had been sized to the full 640 px width.', '2006-05-24 02:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451640, 338028, 39429, '<td valign="top">I really like the tones in the bank and plane.  There''s a nice feel in the lower half of the image.  The centered horizon and bright section of the sky take away from the imact IMO.</td>', 'I really like the tones in the bank and plane.  There''s a nice feel in the lower half of the image.  The centered horizon and bright section of the sky take away from the imact IMO.', '2006-05-24 02:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451641, 337379, 57202, '<td valign="top">Amazed that this was achieved using Basic Editing techniques. :)  Bravo!</td>', 'Amazed that this was achieved using Basic Editing techniques. :)  Bravo!', '2006-05-24 02:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451642, 337267, 57202, '<td valign="top">I like the photo, but am not sure if it is spot-on with the theme of "failure".</td>', 'I like the photo, but am not sure if it is spot-on with the theme of "failure".', '2006-05-24 02:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451643, 338146, 39429, '<td valign="top">The loneliness of the situation is very well portrayed here.  The darkness, and blues add to that feeling.  The yellow tones and beauty of the scene give me hope for him.  A wonderful combination.</td>', 'The loneliness of the situation is very well portrayed here.  The darkness, and blues add to that feeling.  The yellow tones and beauty of the scene give me hope for him.  A wonderful combination.', '2006-05-24 02:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451645, 337991, 57202, '<td valign="top">I like the dramatic lighting in the shot.  However, it would have captivated me more if I could see more of the anguish on her face instead of it being mostly in shadow.</td>', 'I like the dramatic lighting in the shot.  However, it would have captivated me more if I could see more of the anguish on her face instead of it being mostly in shadow.', '2006-05-24 02:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451647, 338099, 57202, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, but wish I could see the flower in the frame (especially given the title).  It''s not really apparant from the photo that those greem stems belong to flowers.</td>', 'I like the shot, but wish I could see the flower in the frame (especially given the title).  It''s not really apparant from the photo that those greem stems belong to flowers.', '2006-05-24 02:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451653, 337623, 57202, '<td valign="top">What luck to have captured this moment! :)</td>', 'What luck to have captured this moment! :)', '2006-05-24 02:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451663, 337255, 57202, '<td valign="top">I love the colors, but actually wish the sky wasn''t so blue.  It would have been nice if the sky was overcast and washed out.  Then you''d have a colder feel to the whole image.  Also, I think that subtle, diffused lighting on the tree (i.e. shot in Golden Hour) would have looked better to emphasize the idea that the tree is dead than these harsh mid-day shadows.</td>', 'I love the colors, but actually wish the sky wasn''t so blue.  It would have been nice if the sky was overcast and washed out.  Then you''d have a colder feel to the whole image.  Also, I think that subtle, diffused lighting on the tree (i.e. shot in Golden Hour) would have looked better to emphasize the idea that the tree is dead than these harsh mid-day shadows.', '2006-05-24 02:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451666, 337520, 14212, '<td valign="top">Excellent Shot! You should ribbon with this one.</td>', 'Excellent Shot! You should ribbon with this one.', '2006-05-24 02:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451667, 338265, 57202, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition, but it seems like his face doesn''t fully convey the fact that he just struck out.  I would expect him to look much more bummed out than this.</td>', 'I really like the composition, but it seems like his face doesn''t fully convey the fact that he just struck out.  I would expect him to look much more bummed out than this.', '2006-05-24 02:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451680, 337768, 57202, '<td valign="top">But why is this "failure"?</td>', 'But why is this "failure"?', '2006-05-24 02:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451682, 337971, 57202, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting here. :D</td>', 'Beautiful lighting here. :D', '2006-05-24 02:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451688, 337370, 57202, '<td valign="top">I think some Levels and Curves adjustments would have made this pop a little more.</td>', 'I think some Levels and Curves adjustments would have made this pop a little more.', '2006-05-24 02:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451689, 337573, 57202, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the action!</td>', 'Great capture of the action!', '2006-05-24 02:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451693, 337660, 57202, '<td valign="top">To me, this just seems to look like a blurry snapshot.  I don''t really see how it conveys the theme of "failure".</td>', 'To me, this just seems to look like a blurry snapshot.  I don''t really see how it conveys the theme of "failure".', '2006-05-24 02:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451699, 338328, 57202, '<td valign="top">Excellent pose to capture. :)</td>', 'Excellent pose to capture. :)', '2006-05-24 02:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451709, 336682, 57202, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot!  I love the sharp focus and beautiful contrast.  And the expression on their faces is perfect! :)</td>', 'Excellent shot!  I love the sharp focus and beautiful contrast.  And the expression on their faces is perfect! :)', '2006-05-24 02:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451717, 337870, 57202, '<td valign="top">I like the dark theme of this image, but wish it was more in-focus and didn''t seem so washed out with highlights.</td>', 'I like the dark theme of this image, but wish it was more in-focus and didn''t seem so washed out with highlights.', '2006-05-24 02:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451720, 337375, 57202, '<td valign="top">I rarely get a chuckle from any contest entries - thank you! :)  Very creative idea.</td>', 'I rarely get a chuckle from any contest entries - thank you! :)  Very creative idea.', '2006-05-24 02:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451723, 337919, 57202, '<td valign="top">Crystal clear and conveys the theme perfectly. :)</td>', 'Crystal clear and conveys the theme perfectly. :)', '2006-05-24 02:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451725, 337820, 57202, '<td valign="top">I don''t really see how this is "failure"...</td>', 'I don''t really see how this is "failure"...', '2006-05-24 02:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451729, 338146, 57202, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and contrast!  The photo also expresses the title perfectly. :)</td>', 'Beautiful colors and contrast!  The photo also expresses the title perfectly. :)', '2006-05-24 02:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451735, 338034, 57202, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but the pieces seem a bit blurry to me (and have a noticeable amount of noise) and the light seems a bit too harsh (and warm).  I would have liked it better if I could see more detail on the pieces and if the lighting was closer to white light (a little colder, almost blue).</td>', 'I like the concept, but the pieces seem a bit blurry to me (and have a noticeable amount of noise) and the light seems a bit too harsh (and warm).  I would have liked it better if I could see more detail on the pieces and if the lighting was closer to white light (a little colder, almost blue).', '2006-05-24 02:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451737, 338073, 7231, '<td valign="top">Well done.  This really captures the emotion of the moment.</td>', 'Well done.  This really captures the emotion of the moment.', '2006-05-24 02:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451740, 336478, 57202, '<td valign="top">I love the harsh and gritty feeling this photo has.  Well done! :)</td>', 'I love the harsh and gritty feeling this photo has.  Well done! :)', '2006-05-24 02:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451741, 337948, 43191, '<td valign="top">Cool macro, not real sure why it''s a failure though.</td>', 'Cool macro, not real sure why it''s a failure though.', '2006-05-24 02:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451743, 337870, 43191, '<td valign="top">This is pretty disturbing.</td>', 'This is pretty disturbing.', '2006-05-24 02:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451744, 338335, 57202, '<td valign="top">Great concept and GREAT photo! :D</td>', 'Great concept and GREAT photo! :D', '2006-05-24 02:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451746, 336974, 43191, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand this.</td>', 'I don''t understand this.', '2006-05-24 02:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451747, 338159, 57202, '<td valign="top">Wow, I feel this photo conveys its title perfectly. :)</td>', 'Wow, I feel this photo conveys its title perfectly. :)', '2006-05-24 02:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451750, 338101, 57202, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, but why is it "failure"?</td>', 'I like the shot, but why is it "failure"?', '2006-05-24 02:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451754, 337511, 53668, '<td valign="top">Hahahah.  You got me good.  I failed to work it out for several minutes.</td>', 'Hahahah.  You got me good.  I failed to work it out for several minutes.', '2006-05-24 02:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451759, 337130, 57202, '<td valign="top">There is way too much harsh blue light in the picture for my taste.  I can barely tell that there is a rose there and can''t tell anything else about the rest of the picture.  It would have been better to me (as a matter of personal taste) if your angle wasn''t so close to top-down and if the light was set up in such a way that I could still see the color of the rose to show up without being washed out in blue.</td>', 'There is way too much harsh blue light in the picture for my taste.  I can barely tell that there is a rose there and can''t tell anything else about the rest of the picture.  It would have been better to me (as a matter of personal taste) if your angle wasn''t so close to top-down and if the light was set up in such a way that I could still see the color of the rose to show up without being washed out in blue.', '2006-05-24 02:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451770, 335865, 57202, '<td valign="top">I like the concept of the shot, but think that the pencil could have been slightly more in focus.  Also, I wish that the white balance was adjusted to cool down the tones of the image a bit and avoid that yellowish-grey color of the paper.</td>', 'I like the concept of the shot, but think that the pencil could have been slightly more in focus.  Also, I wish that the white balance was adjusted to cool down the tones of the image a bit and avoid that yellowish-grey color of the paper.', '2006-05-24 02:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451775, 338028, 57202, '<td valign="top">Well composed and striking contrast. :)  Excellent photo!</td>', 'Well composed and striking contrast. :)  Excellent photo!', '2006-05-24 02:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451780, 337776, 57202, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, but how is this "failure"?</td>', 'Beautiful shot, but how is this "failure"?', '2006-05-24 02:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451785, 337999, 57202, '<td valign="top">One word - WOW.  The color is amazing and the contrast and shadows are perfect! :)</td>', 'One word - WOW.  The color is amazing and the contrast and shadows are perfect! :)', '2006-05-24 02:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451788, 337358, 57202, '<td valign="top">I can''t think of anything that better expresses the concept of "failure". ;)</td>', 'I can''t think of anything that better expresses the concept of "failure". ;)', '2006-05-24 02:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451792, 337752, 57202, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, but the location and angle don''t really fully convey that the tree has been knocked down.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, but the location and angle don''t really fully convey that the tree has been knocked down.', '2006-05-24 02:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451796, 338116, 57202, '<td valign="top">That''s painful to see...  Hopefully that drive had Windoze loaded on it though. ;)</td>', 'That''s painful to see...  Hopefully that drive had Windoze loaded on it though. ;)', '2006-05-24 02:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451805, 337951, 57202, '<td valign="top">Whoa!  Great capture! :)  If I looked over and saw that sight, I may have quite possibly needed a change of shorts.  Very unique occurence to capture. :)</td>', 'Whoa!  Great capture! :)  If I looked over and saw that sight, I may have quite possibly needed a change of shorts.  Very unique occurence to capture. :)', '2006-05-24 02:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451813, 337835, 57202, '<td valign="top">Now I see what you''re trying to convey...  Bump</td>', 'Now I see what you''re trying to convey...  Bump', '2006-05-24 03:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451824, 337678, 57202, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo with spot-on focus.</td>', 'Beautiful photo with spot-on focus.', '2006-05-24 03:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451834, 337658, 57202, '<td valign="top">Seems slightly out of focus to me and I think the colors would have "popped" more if Levels and Color Balance were adjusted.  Great concept though. :)</td>', 'Seems slightly out of focus to me and I think the colors would have "popped" more if Levels and Color Balance were adjusted.  Great concept though. :)', '2006-05-24 03:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451839, 337908, 57202, '<td valign="top">LOL!  [Rolling On the Floor Laughing] :D  Beautiful shot, even with the sensor dust.  Thanks for the humor! :)</td>', 'LOL!  [Rolling On the Floor Laughing] :D  Beautiful shot, even with the sensor dust.  Thanks for the humor! :)', '2006-05-24 03:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451843, 337461, 57202, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit grainy and just slightly out of focus.  The very large grey border is also distracting to me.</td>', 'Seems a bit grainy and just slightly out of focus.  The very large grey border is also distracting to me.', '2006-05-24 03:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451847, 337981, 57202, '<td valign="top">What a great shot! :)  The colors are rich and poweful, the contrast between highlights and shadows is strong, and the pose of the model (along with the setting) convey the title perfectly.  Well done!</td>', 'What a great shot! :)  The colors are rich and poweful, the contrast between highlights and shadows is strong, and the pose of the model (along with the setting) convey the title perfectly.  Well done!', '2006-05-24 03:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451848, 337881, 57202, '<td valign="top">The shot is framed perfectly and the focus is absolutely spot-on! :)  What a great moment to capture - and in such detail!</td>', 'The shot is framed perfectly and the focus is absolutely spot-on! :)  What a great moment to capture - and in such detail!', '2006-05-24 03:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451858, 338126, 57202, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot! :)  [wonders to self how many takes this photo took]</td>', 'Awesome shot! :)  [wonders to self how many takes this photo took]', '2006-05-24 03:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451861, 338335, 49315, '<td valign="top">This will score high *Nods knowingly* 9</td>', 'This will score high *Nods knowingly* 9', '2006-05-24 03:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
