(2451882, 337908, 30861, '<td valign="top">hell of a double rainbow, no question about it, but sort of hard to see this as a "failure" just ''cuz of sensor dust.</td>', 'hell of a double rainbow, no question about it, but sort of hard to see this as a "failure" just ''cuz of sensor dust.', '2006-05-24 03:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451884, 337951, 30861, '<td valign="top">Hey, terrific! You found your vantage point and got your shot!</td>', 'Hey, terrific! You found your vantage point and got your shot!', '2006-05-24 03:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451903, 337995, 30861, '<td valign="top">I have to say, I don''t like the principle being expressed here, that a poor child is somehow a failure. Although I suppose he may FEEL like one, and that makes it real... Not affecting my score anyway, just something I wanted to mention.<br/> <br/>It''s a pity the image has been saved so small, we really can''t see enough detail in the face to connect with this one.</td>', 'I have to say, I don''t like the principle being expressed here, that a poor child is somehow a failure. Although I suppose he may FEEL like one, and that makes it real... Not affecting my score anyway, just something I wanted to mention. It''s a pity the image has been saved so small, we really can''t see enough detail in the face to connect with this one.', '2006-05-24 03:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451905, 336754, 30861, '<td valign="top">Ah, the "grils", Gawd love ''em all :-)</td>', 'Ah, the "grils", Gawd love ''em all :-)', '2006-05-24 03:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451918, 337267, 30861, '<td valign="top">Love it! Not that great a shot really, in a lot of ways, but this is screamingly funny in concept and the execution is competent enough to get a high score from me. Good job!</td>', 'Love it! Not that great a shot really, in a lot of ways, but this is screamingly funny in concept and the execution is competent enough to get a high score from me. Good job!', '2006-05-24 03:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
