(2452681, 337511, 3724, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=104023" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/257/thumb/104023.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/257/thumb/104023.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/257/thumb/104023.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>You may or may not be aware of Gabriel''s previous Competition challenge entry. A brown ribbon success/failure to be sure. An interesting conceptual visual idea for the site - related to inertia, competition &amp; failure.  For me kakorrhaphiophobia, is an unnecessary reminder,  but others may find some merit in it.  Your crop is good.<br/> <br/>Other related previous conceptual renderings:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=184012" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/345/thumb/184012.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/345/thumb/184012.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/345/thumb/184012.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>To my knowledge the first all white entered, with a similar theme to competition and failure. <br/>undecided - from the challenge:  Decisions<br/>by charliebaker <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=7867" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/40/thumb/7867.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/40/thumb/7867.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/40/thumb/7867.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>The first all black entered.<br/>No submission because cameras steal souls - from the challenge: Superstitions &amp; Urban Legends <br/>by ClubJuggle<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=7143" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/38/thumb/7143.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/38/thumb/7143.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/38/thumb/7143.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Also related, a brown ribbon  from the early challenge:  Light Source.<br/>My Hand<br/>by hann<br/> <br/>Non challenge honorable mention.<br/>Bear_Music''s:  Clean - not available.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-05-31 23:58:19.</i></td>', '  You may or may not be aware of Gabriel''s previous Competition challenge entry. A brown ribbon success/failure to be sure. An interesting conceptual visual idea for the site - related to inertia, competition & failure.  For me kakorrhaphiophobia, is an unnecessary reminder,  but others may find some merit in it.  Your crop is good. Other related previous conceptual renderings:   To my knowledge the first all white entered, with a similar theme to competition and failure. undecided - from the challenge:  Decisionsby charliebaker    The first all black entered.No submission because cameras steal souls - from the challenge: Superstitions & Urban Legends by ClubJuggle   Also related, a brown ribbon  from the early challenge:  Light Source.My Handby hann Non challenge honorable mention.Bear_Music''s:  Clean - not available.', '2006-05-24 11:14:22.000000', '2006-06-01 00:58:19.000000', 1),
