(2452876, 338123, 38706, '<td valign="top">Very clever (assuming it''s an illusion rather than the obvious).</td>', 'Very clever (assuming it''s an illusion rather than the obvious).', '2006-05-24 12:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452883, 337379, 52713, '<td valign="top">cool shot, a bit over processed.</td>', 'cool shot, a bit over processed.', '2006-05-24 12:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452893, 338123, 27482, '<td valign="top">Cool but not very convincing, this just feels a bit sterile like it is, would have been much cooler if there was a hand holding the handle with some motion blur or whatever, not having this set up like it is.  Nice job on the lighting and good idea, gave it a 7.</td>', 'Cool but not very convincing, this just feels a bit sterile like it is, would have been much cooler if there was a hand holding the handle with some motion blur or whatever, not having this set up like it is.  Nice job on the lighting and good idea, gave it a 7.', '2006-05-24 12:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452895, 338081, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but I don´t get what I am looking at here, so this shot makes no sense to me.  When shooting something like this, try to put yourself in the voters place who were not at the scene when you took this.  Having something easily recognizable in scale would help.</td>', 'Sorry but I don´t get what I am looking at here, so this shot makes no sense to me.  When shooting something like this, try to put yourself in the voters place who were not at the scene when you took this.  Having something easily recognizable in scale would help.', '2006-05-24 12:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452901, 338126, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but why didn´t you let him hold his head or something, at first I thought he was blowing at the pile till I thought about the theme, that he is supposed to be horrified it is collapsing.</td>', 'Nice idea but why didn´t you let him hold his head or something, at first I thought he was blowing at the pile till I thought about the theme, that he is supposed to be horrified it is collapsing.', '2006-05-24 12:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452920, 337066, 55746, '<td valign="top">Super focus and use of depth of field.  Well done!</td>', 'Super focus and use of depth of field.  Well done!', '2006-05-24 13:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452927, 336800, 55746, '<td valign="top">I like your idea but I nearly missed the arm of the person in the back ground which corresponds with your title.  I bit better lighting may have helped with that.</td>', 'I like your idea but I nearly missed the arm of the person in the back ground which corresponds with your title.  I bit better lighting may have helped with that.', '2006-05-24 13:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452929, 338265, 55746, '<td valign="top">Beautiful contrast and his face really says it all.  Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful contrast and his face really says it all.  Well done.', '2006-05-24 13:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452932, 338320, 55746, '<td valign="top">I am not sure how Jar Jar was a failure.  I think perhaps a close up of his face would have lessened the distraction of all of the overly shiny boxes behind him.</td>', 'I am not sure how Jar Jar was a failure.  I think perhaps a close up of his face would have lessened the distraction of all of the overly shiny boxes behind him.', '2006-05-24 13:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452933, 337883, 59080, '<td valign="top">not sure what this has to do with failure</td>', 'not sure what this has to do with failure', '2006-05-24 13:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452934, 337776, 59080, '<td valign="top">not sure how this relates to the subject matter</td>', 'not sure how this relates to the subject matter', '2006-05-24 13:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452936, 338327, 55746, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject and wonderful colors.  I might have liked to see more to tell me more of the story of the boiler tube but well done nonetheless.</td>', 'Interesting subject and wonderful colors.  I might have liked to see more to tell me more of the story of the boiler tube but well done nonetheless.', '2006-05-24 13:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452938, 335706, 55746, '<td valign="top">Amazing photo.  Incredibly well done.  Please tell more of the story.</td>', 'Amazing photo.  Incredibly well done.  Please tell more of the story.', '2006-05-24 13:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452942, 338224, 55746, '<td valign="top">I like your idea and crop but feel that the photo is not in focus.</td>', 'I like your idea and crop but feel that the photo is not in focus.', '2006-05-24 13:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452944, 336978, 55746, '<td valign="top">I love grain but this seems quite heavy.  Well done nonetheless.</td>', 'I love grain but this seems quite heavy.  Well done nonetheless.', '2006-05-24 13:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452949, 337868, 55746, '<td valign="top">Neat - I especially like the shadow but I do feel that the lighting could have been better.  Well done.</td>', 'Neat - I especially like the shadow but I do feel that the lighting could have been better.  Well done.', '2006-05-24 13:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452950, 337908, 55746, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and neat subject.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice colors and neat subject.  Well done.', '2006-05-24 13:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452951, 336478, 55746, '<td valign="top">Super moody.  I love the contrast and texture.  Good job.</td>', 'Super moody.  I love the contrast and texture.  Good job.', '2006-05-24 13:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452956, 338331, 55746, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting.  Good job.</td>', 'Very nice lighting.  Good job.', '2006-05-24 13:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452958, 336142, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the lighting, not as fond of the fact that there is no way to make it out as a rubix cube, I thought it was a chocolate bar before I saw the title.  6 from me.</td>', 'Nice job on the lighting, not as fond of the fact that there is no way to make it out as a rubix cube, I thought it was a chocolate bar before I saw the title.  6 from me.', '2006-05-24 13:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452959, 337314, 55746, '<td valign="top">Nice clear photo and good lighting.</td>', 'Nice clear photo and good lighting.', '2006-05-24 13:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452960, 337947, 27482, '<td valign="top">Like the makeup and mood in the picture, think she could have been slightly more emotionally dead in the eyes though for me to think of this as a harlot without the title but nice work.  7 from me.</td>', 'Like the makeup and mood in the picture, think she could have been slightly more emotionally dead in the eyes though for me to think of this as a harlot without the title but nice work.  7 from me.', '2006-05-24 13:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452963, 338335, 55746, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  Well done.</td>', 'Great photo.  Well done.', '2006-05-24 13:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452966, 337995, 55746, '<td valign="top">I think this was a good attempt.  Your lighting seems like it may have been good.  This should be as big as DPC allows and, as far as I can tell, it is not in focus.</td>', 'I think this was a good attempt.  Your lighting seems like it may have been good.  This should be as big as DPC allows and, as far as I can tell, it is not in focus.', '2006-05-24 13:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452967, 337573, 27482, '<td valign="top">Had the same idea, to go to a football match and take pictures of either someone scoring a goal (success) or someone in dire cirumstances like this.  Shot is not bad but the moment isn´t really that captivating and interesting.  Still worth a 6 from me though.</td>', 'Had the same idea, to go to a football match and take pictures of either someone scoring a goal (success) or someone in dire cirumstances like this.  Shot is not bad but the moment isn´t really that captivating and interesting.  Still worth a 6 from me though.', '2006-05-24 13:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452970, 337971, 55746, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting.  Looks like ice.  Well done</td>', 'Very nice lighting.  Looks like ice.  Well done', '2006-05-24 13:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452971, 338241, 27482, '<td valign="top">HAHAHAHAHA, this is just too funny!  ROFL!  My wife would KILL me if she ever saw me do the same :)</td>', 'HAHAHAHAHA, this is just too funny!  ROFL!  My wife would KILL me if she ever saw me do the same :)', '2006-05-24 13:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452975, 337375, 55746, '<td valign="top">Ohhhh!  Nice try.  Good job</td>', 'Ohhhh!  Nice try.  Good job', '2006-05-24 13:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452977, 337973, 59080, '<td valign="top">funny--that''s the way i feel most days!</td>', 'funny--that''s the way i feel most days!', '2006-05-24 13:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452978, 337780, 27482, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting that comes from the candle, just not that th candle is in the shot as it´s blown out, it draws too much attention.  Had it been just out of the frame but everything else the same I probably would have given 1 more point.  6 from me, this is pretty good.</td>', 'I like the lighting that comes from the candle, just not that th candle is in the shot as it´s blown out, it draws too much attention.  Had it been just out of the frame but everything else the same I probably would have given 1 more point.  6 from me, this is pretty good.', '2006-05-24 13:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452981, 336135, 55746, '<td valign="top">Well done.  For some reason I feel it would work better rotated... perhaps just me.</td>', 'Well done.  For some reason I feel it would work better rotated... perhaps just me.', '2006-05-24 13:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452983, 337267, 39057, '<td valign="top">My god if this was sharp it would be GREAT !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!</td>', 'My god if this was sharp it would be GREAT !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!', '2006-05-24 13:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452984, 337793, 55746, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo!  Love the contrast and selective saturation.</td>', 'Wonderful photo!  Love the contrast and selective saturation.', '2006-05-24 13:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452986, 337920, 55746, '<td valign="top">Nice job - I love the lines and movement in this photo and your lighting is wonderful.  In a perfect world I think the surfer dead center of the row of columns would have had more impact.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice job - I love the lines and movement in this photo and your lighting is wonderful.  In a perfect world I think the surfer dead center of the row of columns would have had more impact.  Well done.', '2006-05-24 13:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452991, 337780, 55746, '<td valign="top">I hope this is staged and you aren''t fighting this.  I love your picture.  Well done.</td>', 'I hope this is staged and you aren''t fighting this.  I love your picture.  Well done.', '2006-05-24 13:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452993, 335923, 55746, '<td valign="top">I think you were wanting to show that the plant in the back ground is the subject that meets the failure challenge by my eye is kept in the foreground with the logs since the plant is far, tiny and fogged over.  The sun is fading things as well as it is reflecting harshly off of the water.  Your idea is good - just focus some more on your execution.</td>', 'I think you were wanting to show that the plant in the back ground is the subject that meets the failure challenge by my eye is kept in the foreground with the logs since the plant is far, tiny and fogged over.  The sun is fading things as well as it is reflecting harshly off of the water.  Your idea is good - just focus some more on your execution.', '2006-05-24 13:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452994, 337013, 55746, '<td valign="top">Wonderful.  Neat subject, good rhythm and no overexposure.  Rich colors.  Good job.</td>', 'Wonderful.  Neat subject, good rhythm and no overexposure.  Rich colors.  Good job.', '2006-05-24 13:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453003, 337227, 55746, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting and the rainbow colored mess on his face.  Good job.</td>', 'I love the lighting and the rainbow colored mess on his face.  Good job.', '2006-05-24 13:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453005, 338034, 55746, '<td valign="top">Neat grainy picture.  Well done.</td>', 'Neat grainy picture.  Well done.', '2006-05-24 13:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453006, 337951, 18197, '<td valign="top">Right place, right time. Nicely caught. Nicely developed. Would also have been a winner in Photojournalism a few challenges ago.</td>', 'Right place, right time. Nicely caught. Nicely developed. Would also have been a winner in Photojournalism a few challenges ago.', '2006-05-24 13:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453007, 337623, 55746, '<td valign="top">Wow what a find!  There is a bit too much movement or it is not quite in focus but kudos for a neat capture.</td>', 'Wow what a find!  There is a bit too much movement or it is not quite in focus but kudos for a neat capture.', '2006-05-24 13:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453009, 337881, 55746, '<td valign="top">Amazing capture!!!  Good job.</td>', 'Amazing capture!!!  Good job.', '2006-05-24 13:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453012, 336811, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but really lacks the feet and a sens of why she is falling to make sense, is she on a snowboard, skis, did she trip?  You know what I mean :)</td>', 'Nice idea but really lacks the feet and a sens of why she is falling to make sense, is she on a snowboard, skis, did she trip?  You know what I mean :)', '2006-05-24 13:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453014, 337660, 18197, '<td valign="top">The photo certainly lives up to its title. But as a photo, I feel it needs something in focus ... if for no other reason than to give you ee a place to rest. Also suggest making your submissions larger. Bigger images show detail better than small.</td>', 'The photo certainly lives up to its title. But as a photo, I feel it needs something in focus ... if for no other reason than to give you ee a place to rest. Also suggest making your submissions larger. Bigger images show detail better than small.', '2006-05-24 13:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453017, 337132, 27482, '<td valign="top">?  Don´t get it.  Perhaps it would make sense if the wrinting in the window were visible but this shot makes no sense to me.</td>', '?  Don´t get it.  Perhaps it would make sense if the wrinting in the window were visible but this shot makes no sense to me.', '2006-05-24 13:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453025, 337981, 27482, '<td valign="top">Would be cool with a speeding coal train in the backround but this works too :)  Maybe it´s just my sinister nature suggesting that though, hehe.</td>', 'Would be cool with a speeding coal train in the backround but this works too :)  Maybe it´s just my sinister nature suggesting that though, hehe.', '2006-05-24 13:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453032, 337614, 55746, '<td valign="top">I really like this but wish the stone was also in focus.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I really like this but wish the stone was also in focus.  Nicely done.', '2006-05-24 13:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453037, 337832, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but too dark and small to be able to judge fairly, would suggest you stay as close to the 640 pixles you are allowed next and make sure the photo is brighter for a better score.</td>', 'Sorry but too dark and small to be able to judge fairly, would suggest you stay as close to the 640 pixles you are allowed next and make sure the photo is brighter for a better score.', '2006-05-24 13:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453042, 336645, 55746, '<td valign="top">Nice dramatic lighting.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice dramatic lighting.  Well done.', '2006-05-24 13:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453049, 337948, 55746, '<td valign="top">Amazing - love your spot on focus this close and great depth - so much detail is in focus.  In a perfect world I would have liked the other wing to have filled the lower left of the shot for symmetry.  Good job.</td>', 'Amazing - love your spot on focus this close and great depth - so much detail is in focus.  In a perfect world I would have liked the other wing to have filled the lower left of the shot for symmetry.  Good job.', '2006-05-24 13:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
