(2455534, 337066, 36065, '<td valign="top">Great composition and nice lighting.  I also like the depth of field use, but I''d really like to see the back of the ash tray focused and the cig pack left out of focus.  I know...too picky.  Nice capture and great concept.</td>', 'Great composition and nice lighting.  I also like the depth of field use, but I''d really like to see the back of the ash tray focused and the cig pack left out of focus.  I know...too picky.  Nice capture and great concept.', '2006-05-25 02:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455536, 338235, 36065, '<td valign="top">Great tonal range and excellent lighting.  I also like your composition as the lettering and the Sale Sale sign serve to lead the eye in and around the entire frame.</td>', 'Great tonal range and excellent lighting.  I also like your composition as the lettering and the Sale Sale sign serve to lead the eye in and around the entire frame.', '2006-05-25 02:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455539, 337881, 36065, '<td valign="top">Great focus and amazing color.  Really nice timing as well to capture this precise moment and compose a very interesting image.</td>', 'Great focus and amazing color.  Really nice timing as well to capture this precise moment and compose a very interesting image.', '2006-05-25 02:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455541, 337687, 36065, '<td valign="top">I like it.  Beautiful detail and a great high-key sort of feel to this one.  Very neat idea that was very well executed.  One of the best so far.</td>', 'I like it.  Beautiful detail and a great high-key sort of feel to this one.  Very neat idea that was very well executed.  One of the best so far.', '2006-05-25 02:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455543, 337868, 36065, '<td valign="top">This has got to be one of the neatest shadows I have ever seen.  I think I see Mary...post it on ebay...j/k, but that''ll probably draw some death threats.  I like the idea and the composition, but the focus seems to be a bit off all around.  Also, a faster shutter would have served better to stop the toast more crisply.  I still can''t get over that shadow.  Great capture.  More focus and this would have been a top 20 for sure.</td>', 'This has got to be one of the neatest shadows I have ever seen.  I think I see Mary...post it on ebay...j/k, but that''ll probably draw some death threats.  I like the idea and the composition, but the focus seems to be a bit off all around.  Also, a faster shutter would have served better to stop the toast more crisply.  I still can''t get over that shadow.  Great capture.  More focus and this would have been a top 20 for sure.', '2006-05-25 02:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455545, 336141, 36065, '<td valign="top">Very interesting choice of subjects, but the composition of the darts appears too perfectly placed.  I like the idea, but perhaps with the darts a bit more scattered, the composition would have improved.</td>', 'Very interesting choice of subjects, but the composition of the darts appears too perfectly placed.  I like the idea, but perhaps with the darts a bit more scattered, the composition would have improved.', '2006-05-25 02:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455546, 338207, 36065, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, but the blur just doesn''t work for me in this one.  I like the contrast of the image, but the blur is too bothersome.</td>', 'Cool idea, but the blur just doesn''t work for me in this one.  I like the contrast of the image, but the blur is too bothersome.', '2006-05-25 02:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455549, 337658, 36065, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting and great toning.  The various scoring on the page works well to move the viewer''s eye about the frame.  I think the composition would have been better served without the pointing finger.  Rather, just the hand holding the page would have been sufficient.  Still, nicely seen.</td>', 'Interesting lighting and great toning.  The various scoring on the page works well to move the viewer''s eye about the frame.  I think the composition would have been better served without the pointing finger.  Rather, just the hand holding the page would have been sufficient.  Still, nicely seen.', '2006-05-25 02:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455550, 337883, 36065, '<td valign="top">You produced an interesting image that has a cool composition, but I have a hard time realting it to failure.  I like th blue hue and the lighting is great.</td>', 'You produced an interesting image that has a cool composition, but I have a hard time realting it to failure.  I like th blue hue and the lighting is great.', '2006-05-25 02:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455553, 337934, 36065, '<td valign="top">Great tonal range and very interesting composition.  I also like the depth of field taht pushes the viewer right back to the tear and the heartbreakign look on her face.  The only element that bothers me is the teardrop on the tip of her nose.  It almost adds anxiety to the frame based on knowing how annoying that tickling feeling really is.  Still, very well done.</td>', 'Great tonal range and very interesting composition.  I also like the depth of field taht pushes the viewer right back to the tear and the heartbreakign look on her face.  The only element that bothers me is the teardrop on the tip of her nose.  It almost adds anxiety to the frame based on knowing how annoying that tickling feeling really is.  Still, very well done.', '2006-05-25 02:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455554, 338335, 36065, '<td valign="top">I think that a faster shutter speed to stop the motion of some of the sparks would have served this one better.  Nice image and great idea, but I''d like to see the sparks with less light trails.</td>', 'I think that a faster shutter speed to stop the motion of some of the sparks would have served this one better.  Nice image and great idea, but I''d like to see the sparks with less light trails.', '2006-05-25 02:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455556, 337267, 36065, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus and great depth of field, but I only get a small sense of failure from this one.  You captured great detail and a very interesting subject.  I also like the composition as the stalk provide a terrific leading line.</td>', 'Excellent focus and great depth of field, but I only get a small sense of failure from this one.  You captured great detail and a very interesting subject.  I also like the composition as the stalk provide a terrific leading line.', '2006-05-25 02:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455558, 337227, 36065, '<td valign="top">Your flash was a bit too harsh.  The shadow on his right shoulder is very distracting.  You captured a great expression and great catchlights.  He looks like me with one of those suckers.  No way you can stay clean.</td>', 'Your flash was a bit too harsh.  The shadow on his right shoulder is very distracting.  You captured a great expression and great catchlights.  He looks like me with one of those suckers.  No way you can stay clean.', '2006-05-25 02:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455559, 338013, 36065, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but it seems a bit overexposed.  It looks like some detail was lost.  Also adding to that effect is the image''s small size.  Always try to use the full resolution that DPC offers.</td>', 'Great idea, but it seems a bit overexposed.  It looks like some detail was lost.  Also adding to that effect is the image''s small size.  Always try to use the full resolution that DPC offers.', '2006-05-25 02:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455560, 337095, 36065, '<td valign="top">A little too over-processed for my likings.  It looks like there was some selective editing here that really wiped out some of the image''s detail.</td>', 'A little too over-processed for my likings.  It looks like there was some selective editing here that really wiped out some of the image''s detail.', '2006-05-25 02:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455563, 337312, 36065, '<td valign="top">Very well composed.  I like the lighting and the overall coloring of this capture.  Nice idea and well executed.</td>', 'Very well composed.  I like the lighting and the overall coloring of this capture.  Nice idea and well executed.', '2006-05-25 02:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455567, 337132, 36065, '<td valign="top">I think that I understand the scene, but I can''t read the signs.  I called the number, and apparently they are turning the pasta joint into a Mexican Cafe.  That could be a success or a failure depending on your taste.  I do like the image, but I would have liked to have seen more emphasis on one of the small signs.</td>', 'I think that I understand the scene, but I can''t read the signs.  I called the number, and apparently they are turning the pasta joint into a Mexican Cafe.  That could be a success or a failure depending on your taste.  I do like the image, but I would have liked to have seen more emphasis on one of the small signs.', '2006-05-25 02:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455570, 338126, 36065, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a great strength of this image.  Everything about the subject is perfectly isolated off of the background.  I like that.  I would like to see more of the guy and his great expression.  Composed like this, the head look oddly out of place.</td>', 'The lighting is a great strength of this image.  Everything about the subject is perfectly isolated off of the background.  I like that.  I would like to see more of the guy and his great expression.  Composed like this, the head look oddly out of place.', '2006-05-25 02:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455572, 337776, 36065, '<td valign="top">You captured a very well-composed, very strong image, but I have a hard time understanding its relation to failure.  Keep in mind that the average voter spends very little time on each image.  The challenge really needs to jump out.  Still, great capture.  I just don''t get it.</td>', 'You captured a very well-composed, very strong image, but I have a hard time understanding its relation to failure.  Keep in mind that the average voter spends very little time on each image.  The challenge really needs to jump out.  Still, great capture.  I just don''t get it.', '2006-05-25 02:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455577, 337999, 36065, '<td valign="top">Great toning and excellent silhouette capture.  To me, this failure is still a success.  If it were me, I''d feel successful in the fact that I sat fishing all day without working even a little bit.  Still, a superb image that should finish very strongly.</td>', 'Great toning and excellent silhouette capture.  To me, this failure is still a success.  If it were me, I''d feel successful in the fact that I sat fishing all day without working even a little bit.  Still, a superb image that should finish very strongly.', '2006-05-25 03:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455580, 338331, 36065, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, but the composition is a bit too centered for me.  I like your depth of field use to isolate the failure from the success.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice lighting, but the composition is a bit too centered for me.  I like your depth of field use to isolate the failure from the success.  Good job.', '2006-05-25 03:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455582, 337908, 36065, '<td valign="top">Stunning image, but even with the spec, it doesn''t hit me as a failure.  Nice composition and great work with a tough exposure.</td>', 'Stunning image, but even with the spec, it doesn''t hit me as a failure.  Nice composition and great work with a tough exposure.', '2006-05-25 03:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455585, 338094, 36065, '<td valign="top">Powerful image with a great photojournalism feel.  There is almost too much to look at in the scene.  I''d like to see one particular area of failure isolated for the challenge.</td>', 'Powerful image with a great photojournalism feel.  There is almost too much to look at in the scene.  I''d like to see one particular area of failure isolated for the challenge.', '2006-05-25 03:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455586, 338315, 36065, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  Priceless body expression and really nice composition.  The image is just a little too soft, and I''d like to see the stairs level and without that right hand tilt.  Wonderful colors and toning.</td>', 'Excellent!  Priceless body expression and really nice composition.  The image is just a little too soft, and I''d like to see the stairs level and without that right hand tilt.  Wonderful colors and toning.', '2006-05-25 03:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455588, 336771, 36065, '<td valign="top">Man, I''ve been there.  Waiting on the laundry and contemplating where the why the hell I let life lead me to this spot.  Great job with the toning.  You produced a great photograph that is full of emotion.  I can''t tell if that''s a slight tilt or a very wide lens, but it is a little distracting.  I think that its a tilt to the right.</td>', 'Man, I''ve been there.  Waiting on the laundry and contemplating where the why the hell I let life lead me to this spot.  Great job with the toning.  You produced a great photograph that is full of emotion.  I can''t tell if that''s a slight tilt or a very wide lens, but it is a little distracting.  I think that its a tilt to the right.', '2006-05-25 03:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455592, 337972, 36065, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and exposure.  I get more of a tired sense than I do of failure.  I think that if the happy guy running were a bit closer, the failure would be more obvious.  He almost blends right into the crowd.</td>', 'Nice composition and exposure.  I get more of a tired sense than I do of failure.  I think that if the happy guy running were a bit closer, the failure would be more obvious.  He almost blends right into the crowd.', '2006-05-25 03:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455594, 336754, 36065, '<td valign="top">Very nice selecting desaturation, but I really don''t get a sense of failure.  She looks like a beautiful girl with an entire future ahead.  This one would have worked better with some tattered clothes and a dirty alley.  It is a great image that is very, very well composed.  It just doesn''t hit me as a failure.  It''s more of a passing sadness.  Still, a top quality image.</td>', 'Very nice selecting desaturation, but I really don''t get a sense of failure.  She looks like a beautiful girl with an entire future ahead.  This one would have worked better with some tattered clothes and a dirty alley.  It is a great image that is very, very well composed.  It just doesn''t hit me as a failure.  It''s more of a passing sadness.  Still, a top quality image.', '2006-05-25 03:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455596, 338123, 36065, '<td valign="top">Great composition and near-flawless lighting.  I do find the bright light at the bottom left of the squash-thingy a little distracting.  This one fits into the challenge nicely.  Nice image overall.</td>', 'Great composition and near-flawless lighting.  I do find the bright light at the bottom left of the squash-thingy a little distracting.  This one fits into the challenge nicely.  Nice image overall.', '2006-05-25 03:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455600, 338034, 36065, '<td valign="top">Just a bit too dark and noisy.  A little neat image would have improved upon this image.  Nice idea and well composed.</td>', 'Just a bit too dark and noisy.  A little neat image would have improved upon this image.  Nice idea and well composed.', '2006-05-25 03:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455602, 335923, 36065, '<td valign="top">Powerful statement, but the background is a bit too hazy.  Also, the sun''s reflection is bordering on overexposure.  I think that more emphasis on the factory in the distance would have been better.</td>', 'Powerful statement, but the background is a bit too hazy.  Also, the sun''s reflection is bordering on overexposure.  I think that more emphasis on the factory in the distance would have been better.', '2006-05-25 03:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455604, 335865, 36065, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and good composition.  I also like the depth of field that you produced.</td>', 'Nice idea and good composition.  I also like the depth of field that you produced.', '2006-05-25 03:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455607, 338159, 36065, '<td valign="top">You were off to a very powerful photograph here.  My only real issue is that he is too centered.  Moving him to the left onto the thirds line would have made this one much better.  I like the shallow depth of field that isolated him nicely from the busy, successful background.  Great sense of failure, but I''d like to see the composition out of center.</td>', 'You were off to a very powerful photograph here.  My only real issue is that he is too centered.  Moving him to the left onto the thirds line would have made this one much better.  I like the shallow depth of field that isolated him nicely from the busy, successful background.  Great sense of failure, but I''d like to see the composition out of center.', '2006-05-25 03:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455611, 338109, 36065, '<td valign="top">This one fits nicely into the challenge, but it looks like its tilted to the right 5 or 6 degrees.  With the harsh lighting, you also lost some of the detail in the dark face of the statue.</td>', 'This one fits nicely into the challenge, but it looks like its tilted to the right 5 or 6 degrees.  With the harsh lighting, you also lost some of the detail in the dark face of the statue.', '2006-05-25 03:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455613, 337960, 36065, '<td valign="top">HA!  My wife is the same way!  I like the idea, but the backlighting is a little too harsh.  A darker curtain or temporary backdrop would have been an improvement.</td>', 'HA!  My wife is the same way!  I like the idea, but the backlighting is a little too harsh.  A darker curtain or temporary backdrop would have been an improvement.', '2006-05-25 03:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455615, 336811, 36065, '<td valign="top">That is exactly how I spent the day I tried snowboarding.  The next day, I was back on sticks.  Nice shot, but the feet and the board really need to be included.  It looks like a snapshot that accidentally chopped them off as it is.</td>', 'That is exactly how I spent the day I tried snowboarding.  The next day, I was back on sticks.  Nice shot, but the feet and the board really need to be included.  It looks like a snapshot that accidentally chopped them off as it is.', '2006-05-25 03:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455617, 337428, 36065, '<td valign="top">Man, that''s gonna suck, but it sure is good for clearing the sinuses.  Great timing and great capture, but the tilt really bothers me.  Its one of my biggest pet peeves.</td>', 'Man, that''s gonna suck, but it sure is good for clearing the sinuses.  Great timing and great capture, but the tilt really bothers me.  Its one of my biggest pet peeves.', '2006-05-25 03:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455619, 337973, 36065, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and nice tones, but this one makes me think too much.  I like the various tones produced by the different lighting.</td>', 'Great lighting and nice tones, but this one makes me think too much.  I like the various tones produced by the different lighting.', '2006-05-25 03:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455622, 338260, 36065, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a little off.  The shadows are on your subject, while the highlights are limited to the background.  Spinning him around and shooting from the other side would be a big help.</td>', 'The lighting is a little off.  The shadows are on your subject, while the highlights are limited to the background.  Spinning him around and shooting from the other side would be a big help.', '2006-05-25 03:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455626, 337037, 36065, '<td valign="top">I like the selective desaturation, but he really gets lost in the busy background.  I think a little closer composition would help a great deal.</td>', 'I like the selective desaturation, but he really gets lost in the busy background.  I think a little closer composition would help a great deal.', '2006-05-25 03:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455627, 337660, 36065, '<td valign="top">Always try to post the largest size that DOC allows.  Small images really lose a lot of detail, thus really don''t score very well.</td>', 'Always try to post the largest size that DOC allows.  Small images really lose a lot of detail, thus really don''t score very well.', '2006-05-25 03:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455630, 336953, 36065, '<td valign="top">While I like the toning of the capture, the blurred foreground is a bit distracting to me.  I do like the shallow depth of field, I''d just prefer that the focus was more toward the from than the dead center of the photograph.  Very interesting shadows and great texture.</td>', 'While I like the toning of the capture, the blurred foreground is a bit distracting to me.  I do like the shallow depth of field, I''d just prefer that the focus was more toward the from than the dead center of the photograph.  Very interesting shadows and great texture.', '2006-05-25 03:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455634, 336891, 36065, '<td valign="top">Also, failure to make a good breakfast.  Nicely seen and very well captured.  The black part of the frame is a little too much, but still a great image.  Did you feel bad after you tossed that out of the nest? (KIDDING)</td>', 'Also, failure to make a good breakfast.  Nicely seen and very well captured.  The black part of the frame is a little too much, but still a great image.  Did you feel bad after you tossed that out of the nest? (KIDDING)', '2006-05-25 03:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455637, 337820, 36065, '<td valign="top">Your tones almost all blend together here, making the failure difficult to distinguish.  I like the shallow depth of field, but it needs a bit better contrast.</td>', 'Your tones almost all blend together here, making the failure difficult to distinguish.  I like the shallow depth of field, but it needs a bit better contrast.', '2006-05-25 03:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455638, 337287, 36065, '<td valign="top">I like the deep blue sky and the angle you chose for the shot.  Together they provide for a very nice composition.  I just don''t get the failure.</td>', 'I like the deep blue sky and the angle you chose for the shot.  Together they provide for a very nice composition.  I just don''t get the failure.', '2006-05-25 03:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455639, 337940, 36065, '<td valign="top">Your tones almost blend together here.  The branch and the sky are too close to the same tone.  I think a higher shooting angle would have helped out.</td>', 'Your tones almost blend together here.  The branch and the sky are too close to the same tone.  I think a higher shooting angle would have helped out.', '2006-05-25 03:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455641, 336043, 36065, '<td valign="top">Very interesting find.  I''d like to see a more shallow depth of field for this one.  The farm on the hill is a bit too competitive, pulling the viewer''s eye more toward it and away from the subject.</td>', 'Very interesting find.  I''d like to see a more shallow depth of field for this one.  The farm on the hill is a bit too competitive, pulling the viewer''s eye more toward it and away from the subject.', '2006-05-25 03:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455643, 337947, 36065, '<td valign="top">9 bucks?!?!  I''m in!  Great creativity and a wonderful (read HOT) model!  The scene plays very well together to produce a strong mood and a feeling of failure.  The only distraction is the big shadow on the wall over the lucky man that just got an amazing deal.  Really nice capture.</td>', '9 bucks?!?!  I''m in!  Great creativity and a wonderful (read HOT) model!  The scene plays very well together to produce a strong mood and a feeling of failure.  The only distraction is the big shadow on the wall over the lucky man that just got an amazing deal.  Really nice capture.', '2006-05-25 03:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455645, 338081, 36065, '<td valign="top">This one produces a great sense of anticipation.  I am left waiting to see the water fall.  I think I''d like to see it just an instant later with the balloon popped, but the water retaining the shape.</td>', 'This one produces a great sense of anticipation.  I am left waiting to see the water fall.  I think I''d like to see it just an instant later with the balloon popped, but the water retaining the shape.', '2006-05-25 03:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455647, 338288, 36065, '<td valign="top">We did not fail, we are just waiting for the right moment to claim total victory.  Well seen and nicely captured, especially with the harsh lighting.  My only critique is that the shadow on the face of the soldier looking our way is a bit harsh.  Still, nice capture.</td>', 'We did not fail, we are just waiting for the right moment to claim total victory.  Well seen and nicely captured, especially with the harsh lighting.  My only critique is that the shadow on the face of the soldier looking our way is a bit harsh.  Still, nice capture.', '2006-05-25 03:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455648, 337255, 36065, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see this one taken just before the sun rose or just after it sets.  As it ism the light/shadow split is a bit too centered.  Nice job meeting the challenge.</td>', 'I''d like to see this one taken just before the sun rose or just after it sets.  As it ism the light/shadow split is a bit too centered.  Nice job meeting the challenge.', '2006-05-25 03:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455649, 337013, 36065, '<td valign="top">I am so pleased that the horizon is almost perfectly horizontal.  I also think that the centered composition works very, very well for this shot.  Very nice contrast between the beach, water, and sky.  Well seen and well captured.</td>', 'I am so pleased that the horizon is almost perfectly horizontal.  I also think that the centered composition works very, very well for this shot.  Very nice contrast between the beach, water, and sky.  Well seen and well captured.', '2006-05-25 03:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455653, 338187, 36065, '<td valign="top">Always try to post the image with the maximum dimension that DPC allows.  Small images really lose detail, thus normally score poorly.  It looks like a great concept, but it''s just too hard to see.</td>', 'Always try to post the image with the maximum dimension that DPC allows.  Small images really lose detail, thus normally score poorly.  It looks like a great concept, but it''s just too hard to see.', '2006-05-25 03:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455656, 338294, 36065, '<td valign="top">You can''t park there!!  Great contrasting colors and crisp focus.  I do find the strangely shaped building at the top of the hill mildly distracting.</td>', 'You can''t park there!!  Great contrasting colors and crisp focus.  I do find the strangely shaped building at the top of the hill mildly distracting.', '2006-05-25 03:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455658, 338248, 36065, '<td valign="top">Very creative, and you pulled a pretty good laugh out of me.  How long did it take for you to kill it? (KIDDING)  I like it.  Very well composed.</td>', 'Very creative, and you pulled a pretty good laugh out of me.  How long did it take for you to kill it? (KIDDING)  I like it.  Very well composed.', '2006-05-25 03:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455659, 336036, 36065, '<td valign="top">I can still see a fair amount of detail, but it''s still a bit too small.  Interesting concept and nice lighting, but always try to use your full size parameters that DPC offers.</td>', 'I can still see a fair amount of detail, but it''s still a bit too small.  Interesting concept and nice lighting, but always try to use your full size parameters that DPC offers.', '2006-05-25 04:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455660, 336800, 36065, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but the skin and carpet colors are too close, making the arm difficult to see.</td>', 'Interesting, but the skin and carpet colors are too close, making the arm difficult to see.', '2006-05-25 04:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455663, 338224, 36065, '<td valign="top">The focus seems to be a bit off in the area of the face.  Nice tonal range in your conversion.  Always try to use the full size parameters that DPC allows.  Smaller images loos a great deal of detail and make them hard to score fairly.</td>', 'The focus seems to be a bit off in the area of the face.  Nice tonal range in your conversion.  Always try to use the full size parameters that DPC allows.  Smaller images loos a great deal of detail and make them hard to score fairly.', '2006-05-25 04:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455665, 338255, 36065, '<td valign="top">Amazing stop-action shot.  Excellent exposure, great depth of field, awesome expression, and I could go on and on.  This one is sure to do very well.</td>', 'Amazing stop-action shot.  Excellent exposure, great depth of field, awesome expression, and I could go on and on.  This one is sure to do very well.', '2006-05-25 04:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455666, 337835, 36065, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, but blurred images are difficult for me to look at.</td>', 'Nice colors, but blurred images are difficult for me to look at.', '2006-05-25 04:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455669, 338285, 36065, '<td valign="top">I think that a deeper depth of field would have helped out here.  Very creative idea, but I''d like to see the head area around the Folger''s label in focus as well.</td>', 'I think that a deeper depth of field would have helped out here.  Very creative idea, but I''d like to see the head area around the Folger''s label in focus as well.', '2006-05-25 04:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455671, 336135, 36065, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but this one is a bit too busy.  I like the texture that you created with the wrinkled test, but I think everything other than it and the pencil should have been excluded.</td>', 'Nice idea, but this one is a bit too busy.  I like the texture that you created with the wrinkled test, but I think everything other than it and the pencil should have been excluded.', '2006-05-25 04:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455674, 336478, 36065, '<td valign="top">Great capture, but a bit over-precessed.  It looks like neat image, and you lost some of her face detail with too much of it.  Also, I''d like to see her shifted away from the center a bit.</td>', 'Great capture, but a bit over-precessed.  It looks like neat image, and you lost some of her face detail with too much of it.  Also, I''d like to see her shifted away from the center a bit.', '2006-05-25 04:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455677, 338322, 36065, '<td valign="top">A landscape orientation would have served this one a bit better.  I''d liek to see a bit more of the building.</td>', 'A landscape orientation would have served this one a bit better.  I''d liek to see a bit more of the building.', '2006-05-25 04:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455679, 337358, 36065, '<td valign="top">I just don''t like political statements where I go for enjoyment whether I agree or disagree.</td>', 'I just don''t like political statements where I go for enjoyment whether I agree or disagree.', '2006-05-25 04:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455682, 336981, 36065, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrayal of a failing society, but I don''t think WE are the failure.  I eradicated poverty from my family.  I like your vantage point, but the two bottom trees are somewhat distracting.</td>', 'Excellent portrayal of a failing society, but I don''t think WE are the failure.  I eradicated poverty from my family.  I like your vantage point, but the two bottom trees are somewhat distracting.', '2006-05-25 04:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455684, 338163, 36065, '<td valign="top">You got a chuckle.  This is one of my favorites thus far.  I really like the feeling that you have produced here.  I have felt that same way a time or two, so I gave up on those silly sticks long ago.  This should finish well!</td>', 'You got a chuckle.  This is one of my favorites thus far.  I really like the feeling that you have produced here.  I have felt that same way a time or two, so I gave up on those silly sticks long ago.  This should finish well!', '2006-05-25 04:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455688, 337832, 36065, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit too dark, but the main problem is the size.  Always try to use the full size parameter allowed by DPC.  Small images lose detail and normally do not score very highly.</td>', 'It''s a bit too dark, but the main problem is the size.  Always try to use the full size parameter allowed by DPC.  Small images lose detail and normally do not score very highly.', '2006-05-25 04:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455691, 337841, 36065, '<td valign="top">It looks more like he is getting ready to bat rather than finished.  Perhaps getting him walking away with an angered expression or catching him at the end of his swing would have fit a bit better.</td>', 'It looks more like he is getting ready to bat rather than finished.  Perhaps getting him walking away with an angered expression or catching him at the end of his swing would have fit a bit better.', '2006-05-25 04:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455693, 337375, 36065, '<td valign="top">I understand the shot, and it fits the challenge, but I still prefer to see high-quality images that produce an feeling of failure rather than a failed image.</td>', 'I understand the shot, and it fits the challenge, but I still prefer to see high-quality images that produce an feeling of failure rather than a failed image.', '2006-05-25 04:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455726, 337870, 59107, '<td valign="top">*shakes head*  this isnt good</td>', '*shakes head*  this isnt good', '2006-05-25 04:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455731, 338123, 36141, '<td valign="top">I don''t think a knife could break that way in that position, but your photo looks nice.</td>', 'I don''t think a knife could break that way in that position, but your photo looks nice.', '2006-05-25 04:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455743, 337267, 8860, '<td valign="top">This sould be a hands-down winner if it were fully crisp and focused. That truly is a big shame, because with a macro it''s essential. This is a fantastic choice of subject though and it''s well composed so far that you deserve credit.</td>', 'This sould be a hands-down winner if it were fully crisp and focused. That truly is a big shame, because with a macro it''s essential. This is a fantastic choice of subject though and it''s well composed so far that you deserve credit.', '2006-05-25 05:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455853, 338073, 59548, '<td valign="top">We all have those days.  Nice shot!</td>', 'We all have those days.  Nice shot!', '2006-05-25 07:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455858, 337267, 59548, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and lovely colours. But uh, could be sharper..</td>', 'Nice composition and lovely colours. But uh, could be sharper..', '2006-05-25 07:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455952, 337971, 43774, '<td valign="top">This looks like a negative image....it''s very striking. I like your composition, well done.</td>', 'This looks like a negative image....it''s very striking. I like your composition, well done.', '2006-05-25 09:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455953, 338159, 43774, '<td valign="top">This is a great candid shot. We can presume the cart is full of his only posessions, his pose speaks volumes and even the bench has graffiti on it, adding to the mood. Well done.</td>', 'This is a great candid shot. We can presume the cart is full of his only posessions, his pose speaks volumes and even the bench has graffiti on it, adding to the mood. Well done.', '2006-05-25 09:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456018, 337870, 36065, '<td valign="top">Always try to use the full size that DPC allows.  Smaller photos lose detail and usually score poorly.</td>', 'Always try to use the full size that DPC allows.  Smaller photos lose detail and usually score poorly.', '2006-05-25 10:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456023, 337678, 36065, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject and a very nice macro shot.  The lighting is a bit flat and the composition is plain.  I do like the fact that the viewer can see the various working part and labels.  Those work well at drawing the viewer''s eye around the frame.</td>', 'Interesting subject and a very nice macro shot.  The lighting is a bit flat and the composition is plain.  I do like the fact that the viewer can see the various working part and labels.  Those work well at drawing the viewer''s eye around the frame.', '2006-05-25 10:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456028, 337294, 36065, '<td valign="top">Your title choice pulls this one down a bit.  I normally ignore titles, but I read this one since it wasn''t immediately obvious what it was.  It pulls it down since the fire is indeed out, it was just extinguished a lot too late.  Nice idea, but the darkness of the charred interior makes is difficult to understand.</td>', 'Your title choice pulls this one down a bit.  I normally ignore titles, but I read this one since it wasn''t immediately obvious what it was.  It pulls it down since the fire is indeed out, it was just extinguished a lot too late.  Nice idea, but the darkness of the charred interior makes is difficult to understand.', '2006-05-25 10:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456031, 337971, 36065, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, and the shot is well done from a technical standpoint.  I think that the success of the standing pieces actually overshadows the failure of the lone, lying king.</td>', 'I like the idea, and the shot is well done from a technical standpoint.  I think that the success of the standing pieces actually overshadows the failure of the lone, lying king.', '2006-05-25 10:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456034, 338028, 36065, '<td valign="top">You can''t park there!  Mice capture, but the backlighting overpowers the subject.  Well seen and nicely composed, but the lighting needs some work.</td>', 'You can''t park there!  Mice capture, but the backlighting overpowers the subject.  Well seen and nicely composed, but the lighting needs some work.', '2006-05-25 10:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456036, 337314, 36065, '<td valign="top">Always try to use the full size parameters that DPC allows.  Smaller images always lose detail.  This is a nice capture with good contrasting colors, but I''d like to see it at 640 px.</td>', 'Always try to use the full size parameters that DPC allows.  Smaller images always lose detail.  This is a nice capture with good contrasting colors, but I''d like to see it at 640 px.', '2006-05-25 10:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456038, 338219, 36065, '<td valign="top">This is a tough subject to convey to a viewer in a photo since it looks like he is stopped.  Perhaps a slow shutter speed to capture a trail of the vehicle would portray the feeling better.</td>', 'This is a tough subject to convey to a viewer in a photo since it looks like he is stopped.  Perhaps a slow shutter speed to capture a trail of the vehicle would portray the feeling better.', '2006-05-25 10:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456041, 337919, 36065, '<td valign="top">I do get the feeling of failure from this capture, but it needs some work technically.  The lighting is a bit harsh and really gives some harsh highlights and deep shadows on your subject.  Nice composition, but I''d like to see a shallow depth of field to help isolate him from the background.</td>', 'I do get the feeling of failure from this capture, but it needs some work technically.  The lighting is a bit harsh and really gives some harsh highlights and deep shadows on your subject.  Nice composition, but I''d like to see a shallow depth of field to help isolate him from the background.', '2006-05-25 10:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456045, 338101, 36065, '<td valign="top">It took me a few seconds to understand this image.  The message you are trying to convey isn''t quite obvious enough for viewers that vote here.  Great coloring and interesting composition, but the sign to the left is a bit difficult to see at first.  Keep in mind that voters only spend a few seconds on each image here.  This one was likely passed over with lower votes since it didn''t jump out with the obvious challenge detail.</td>', 'It took me a few seconds to understand this image.  The message you are trying to convey isn''t quite obvious enough for viewers that vote here.  Great coloring and interesting composition, but the sign to the left is a bit difficult to see at first.  Keep in mind that voters only spend a few seconds on each image here.  This one was likely passed over with lower votes since it didn''t jump out with the obvious challenge detail.', '2006-05-25 10:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456049, 337461, 36065, '<td valign="top">Nice subject choice, but the image seems out of focus.  Also, be sure to use the full 640 px that DPC allows.  Smaller images lose much needed detail.</td>', 'Nice subject choice, but the image seems out of focus.  Also, be sure to use the full 640 px that DPC allows.  Smaller images lose much needed detail.', '2006-05-25 10:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456051, 337981, 36065, '<td valign="top">I like the colors, the composition and the great leading lines.  The exposure and depth of field are also really great, but I don''t really get a sense of failure from this one.  Hopeless, but not particularly failure.</td>', 'I like the colors, the composition and the great leading lines.  The exposure and depth of field are also really great, but I don''t really get a sense of failure from this one.  Hopeless, but not particularly failure.', '2006-05-25 10:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456052, 337573, 36065, '<td valign="top">The composition is a bit busy, and I don''t really feel failure here.  It looks like this is just an isolated moment in a long game.  You did capture a terrific expression in a really nice stop-action shot, though.</td>', 'The composition is a bit busy, and I don''t really feel failure here.  It looks like this is just an isolated moment in a long game.  You did capture a terrific expression in a really nice stop-action shot, though.', '2006-05-25 10:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456056, 337948, 36065, '<td valign="top">Excellent macro shot, but I don''t find the failure.  The detail here is superb, the depth of field is great, but the overall composition is a little bit too centered.</td>', 'Excellent macro shot, but I don''t find the failure.  The detail here is superb, the depth of field is great, but the overall composition is a little bit too centered.', '2006-05-25 10:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456058, 337768, 36065, '<td valign="top">This is a bit too busy with too many distractions.  I do get a sense of failure, but the vegetation on either side of the frame is distracting and competes for attention with the subject.</td>', 'This is a bit too busy with too many distractions.  I do get a sense of failure, but the vegetation on either side of the frame is distracting and competes for attention with the subject.', '2006-05-25 10:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456062, 338306, 36065, '<td valign="top">It looks like you may have a great photograph here, but the size is too small to tell for sure.  Always try to use the full size parameter that DPC allows.  Smaller images lose important detail and tend to do poorly.  I''d really like to see this one in a larger size after the voting is finished.</td>', 'It looks like you may have a great photograph here, but the size is too small to tell for sure.  Always try to use the full size parameter that DPC allows.  Smaller images lose important detail and tend to do poorly.  I''d really like to see this one in a larger size after the voting is finished.', '2006-05-25 10:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456064, 338099, 36065, '<td valign="top">Cool capture and interesting concept, but that little, blurry weed in the front overpowers the subject.  I think I would have failed it first, then taken the shot.</td>', 'Cool capture and interesting concept, but that little, blurry weed in the front overpowers the subject.  I think I would have failed it first, then taken the shot.', '2006-05-25 10:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456066, 338249, 36065, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the mood that this image projects, but I am not putting the various elements together very well.  I understand the rifle and the feeling of dejection, but I am missing the point of the paint and hammer.  Nice image and good mood for the challenge.  I can''t wait to read your photographer''s comments for the rest of the story.</td>', 'I like the idea and the mood that this image projects, but I am not putting the various elements together very well.  I understand the rifle and the feeling of dejection, but I am missing the point of the paint and hammer.  Nice image and good mood for the challenge.  I can''t wait to read your photographer''s comments for the rest of the story.', '2006-05-25 10:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456070, 338247, 36065, '<td valign="top">Your flash was a bit too powerful in this one.  The hand and hair yield some harsh shadows and her features look flat.  Neat idea and a great expression.</td>', 'Your flash was a bit too powerful in this one.  The hand and hair yield some harsh shadows and her features look flat.  Neat idea and a great expression.', '2006-05-25 10:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456073, 338327, 36065, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to tell what this one is.  I think it would do great in an abstract challenge, but it isn''t readily obvious what the failure was.  Nice composition, crisp focus and great complementary colors.  Well seen and well captured, but more suited for a different challenge.</td>', 'It''s hard to tell what this one is.  I think it would do great in an abstract challenge, but it isn''t readily obvious what the failure was.  Nice composition, crisp focus and great complementary colors.  Well seen and well captured, but more suited for a different challenge.', '2006-05-25 10:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456078, 337793, 36065, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subject choice, but the image doesn''t really project failure.  I can see that this is obviously a poor man, but I get a feeling that he is good at something, thus not a complete failure.  Well seen, and I like the selective desaturation that you produced.</td>', 'Very interesting subject choice, but the image doesn''t really project failure.  I can see that this is obviously a poor man, but I get a feeling that he is good at something, thus not a complete failure.  Well seen, and I like the selective desaturation that you produced.', '2006-05-25 10:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456079, 336645, 36065, '<td valign="top">Nice low-key shot, but the composition is a bit too centered.  I do get an ominous feeling from the positioning of the subject, so I think that it meets the challenge well.</td>', 'Nice low-key shot, but the composition is a bit too centered.  I do get an ominous feeling from the positioning of the subject, so I think that it meets the challenge well.', '2006-05-25 10:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456083, 337623, 36065, '<td valign="top">Now this is a capture of impeccable timing.  The focus feels a little soft and I don''t quite see the failure.  Still, this is a pretty nice image.</td>', 'Now this is a capture of impeccable timing.  The focus feels a little soft and I don''t quite see the failure.  Still, this is a pretty nice image.', '2006-05-25 10:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456085, 337301, 36065, '<td valign="top">I do get a strong sense of failure here, but the lighting needs some work.  It look almost backlit from the photograph.  If the light were behind you, you''d have a much more powerful capture.  Also, the composition is a bit too centered.</td>', 'I do get a strong sense of failure here, but the lighting needs some work.  It look almost backlit from the photograph.  If the light were behind you, you''d have a much more powerful capture.  Also, the composition is a bit too centered.', '2006-05-25 10:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456089, 337156, 36065, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, great focus and good timing.  The composition is not bad, but I''d like to see the rest of that sail.</td>', 'Nice capture, great focus and good timing.  The composition is not bad, but I''d like to see the rest of that sail.', '2006-05-25 10:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456091, 338197, 36065, '<td valign="top">He looks a little too happy to fit into the category of a failure.  Excellent composition and great lighting for this shot.  The blurred umbrella doesn''t really add anything to the image.  Nice work, but better suited for a different challenge.</td>', 'He looks a little too happy to fit into the category of a failure.  Excellent composition and great lighting for this shot.  The blurred umbrella doesn''t really add anything to the image.  Nice work, but better suited for a different challenge.', '2006-05-25 10:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456093, 337379, 36065, '<td valign="top">I like your composition and vantage point here, but the post-processing is just too much.  The sky is too harsh while the lighting in the subject looks flat.  It also looks like there was some dodging and burning in the workflow.</td>', 'I like your composition and vantage point here, but the post-processing is just too much.  The sky is too harsh while the lighting in the subject looks flat.  It also looks like there was some dodging and burning in the workflow.', '2006-05-25 10:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456094, 337752, 36065, '<td valign="top">The lighting doesn''t do this one justice.  I know there are some great greens in the shot, but it looks a little too dark.  I think a different position that excluded the wet sidewalk would have helped achieve a much better exposure.  As it is, that one overexposed spot grabs all the attention.</td>', 'The lighting doesn''t do this one justice.  I know there are some great greens in the shot, but it looks a little too dark.  I think a different position that excluded the wet sidewalk would have helped achieve a much better exposure.  As it is, that one overexposed spot grabs all the attention.', '2006-05-25 10:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456095, 336803, 36065, '<td valign="top">Great expression and interesting subject, but I don''t get a strong sense of failure.  It looks like he got what he was after.  Also, one more light set up to give the hair some detail would have helped out tremendously.</td>', 'Great expression and interesting subject, but I don''t get a strong sense of failure.  It looks like he got what he was after.  Also, one more light set up to give the hair some detail would have helped out tremendously.', '2006-05-25 10:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456136, 338081, 59148, '<td valign="top">How is this failure?</td>', 'How is this failure?', '2006-05-25 11:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456142, 336953, 59148, '<td valign="top">Nice composition good depth.</td>', 'Nice composition good depth.', '2006-05-25 11:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456143, 337678, 59148, '<td valign="top">how can you tell it if fails to work?</td>', 'how can you tell it if fails to work?', '2006-05-25 11:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456145, 337995, 59148, '<td valign="top">You can be poor and not a failure.bad lighting</td>', 'You can be poor and not a failure.bad lighting', '2006-05-25 11:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456146, 338315, 59148, '<td valign="top">Good color nice softening of the light. Follows the subject matter well.</td>', 'Good color nice softening of the light. Follows the subject matter well.', '2006-05-25 11:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
