(2457940, 338240, 36065, '<td valign="top">It is really hard to tell what your subject is here and where exactly the failure is.  It looks like your shutter speed was low and the shot was handheld, giving the entire photograph some blur.  I do like the flowing composition, but I can''t isolate the failure.</td>', 'It is really hard to tell what your subject is here and where exactly the failure is.  It looks like your shutter speed was low and the shot was handheld, giving the entire photograph some blur.  I do like the flowing composition, but I can''t isolate the failure.', '2006-05-25 20:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457948, 338256, 36065, '<td valign="top">Well seen and I like the tight composition here.  I also like the way the leg looks like an arm painfully trying to push itself up.  I think that the lighting could have been a little better.  The shadow on the left is somewhat distracting.</td>', 'Well seen and I like the tight composition here.  I also like the way the leg looks like an arm painfully trying to push itself up.  I think that the lighting could have been a little better.  The shadow on the left is somewhat distracting.', '2006-05-25 20:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457953, 337358, 39057, '<td valign="top">I absolutly hate when people express their political beliefs with their (challenge)photographs. It sickens me!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-05-31 00:22:44.</i></td>', 'I absolutly hate when people express their political beliefs with their (challenge)photographs. It sickens me!', '2006-05-25 20:55:15.000000', '2006-05-31 01:22:44.000000', 1),
(2457957, 335706, 36065, '<td valign="top">While I am a bi fan of sepia toning, I think that it really hurts this capture.  By converting to sepia, some of your details blend together and get lost here.  Great composition and I like the moody feeling, but I get more of a sense of pain and loneliness than failure.</td>', 'While I am a bi fan of sepia toning, I think that it really hurts this capture.  By converting to sepia, some of your details blend together and get lost here.  Great composition and I like the moody feeling, but I get more of a sense of pain and loneliness than failure.', '2006-05-25 20:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457958, 337511, 39057, '<td valign="top">You''re kidding....I refreshed my screen twice !</td>', 'You''re kidding....I refreshed my screen twice !', '2006-05-25 20:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457960, 336978, 36065, '<td valign="top">Cool portrait with interesting composition, but I don''t get a sense of failure.  I like the tight composition and the grainy feel of the image.  I see more of a disgust look than one of failure.</td>', 'Cool portrait with interesting composition, but I don''t get a sense of failure.  I like the tight composition and the grainy feel of the image.  I see more of a disgust look than one of failure.', '2006-05-25 20:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457964, 338073, 36065, '<td valign="top">I can definitely see failure here.  Great expression and a very nice capture.  I am not a big fan of the noise in this one, and I would like to see the rest of his right elbow.  I think that chopping it off leads the eye right out of the frame.</td>', 'I can definitely see failure here.  Great expression and a very nice capture.  I am not a big fan of the noise in this one, and I would like to see the rest of his right elbow.  I think that chopping it off leads the eye right out of the frame.', '2006-05-25 20:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457969, 337370, 36065, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, and I think that you meet the challenge, but there really isn''t enough emphasis on the sign.  I think a tighter composition with a more shallow depth of field would help direct the viewer more toward the warning, while still seeing a blurred environment in the background.</td>', 'I like the idea, and I think that you meet the challenge, but there really isn''t enough emphasis on the sign.  I think a tighter composition with a more shallow depth of field would help direct the viewer more toward the warning, while still seeing a blurred environment in the background.', '2006-05-25 21:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457971, 337920, 39057, '<td valign="top">I just don''t see this as a failure...nice shot though</td>', 'I just don''t see this as a failure...nice shot though', '2006-05-25 21:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457975, 338170, 36065, '<td valign="top">Great toning and interesting composition, but I think that I would have lest the man out of the frame.  His direction of travel really leads the viewer right out of the frame with anticipation of his next step.</td>', 'Great toning and interesting composition, but I think that I would have lest the man out of the frame.  His direction of travel really leads the viewer right out of the frame with anticipation of his next step.', '2006-05-25 21:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457981, 337532, 36065, '<td valign="top">The image looks very pixelated on my monitor.  Great sports capture and strong expressions, but I don''t really get a sense of failure.  It seems like just a small portion of a much longer game.</td>', 'The image looks very pixelated on my monitor.  Great sports capture and strong expressions, but I don''t really get a sense of failure.  It seems like just a small portion of a much longer game.', '2006-05-25 21:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457983, 336682, 36065, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and a very interesting way to present failure.  I think that it works very well.  It seems like your focus is a hair off, and it''s definitely time to clean that sensor.</td>', 'Nice composition and a very interesting way to present failure.  I think that it works very well.  It seems like your focus is a hair off, and it''s definitely time to clean that sensor.', '2006-05-25 21:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457986, 336142, 36065, '<td valign="top">I like the flame shot, but I don''t feel the failure here.  The WB you chose gives a very nice, warm, moody feeling and your focus is nice.</td>', 'I like the flame shot, but I don''t feel the failure here.  The WB you chose gives a very nice, warm, moody feeling and your focus is nice.', '2006-05-25 21:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457987, 336974, 36065, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition and great exposure, but I do not get the failure in this one.  I like the intentional tilt, as it really serves well to lead the viewer around the frame.</td>', 'Interesting composition and great exposure, but I do not get the failure in this one.  I like the intentional tilt, as it really serves well to lead the viewer around the frame.', '2006-05-25 21:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457991, 337520, 36065, '<td valign="top">He''s doing it wrong!  I really like this  one, and it was actually the exact idea that I had.  I just didn''t get to make the 4 hour ride up to the river.  Nicely seen and very well captured.  The composition is excellent and the crisp, stopped motion is spectacular.  This is one of my top 10 in the overall challenge, and it should finish pretty well.</td>', 'He''s doing it wrong!  I really like this  one, and it was actually the exact idea that I had.  I just didn''t get to make the 4 hour ride up to the river.  Nicely seen and very well captured.  The composition is excellent and the crisp, stopped motion is spectacular.  This is one of my top 10 in the overall challenge, and it should finish pretty well.', '2006-05-25 21:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457993, 337780, 36065, '<td valign="top">I see the failure very well, but I''d like to see a bit different composition.  The depth of field is nice, but centering the focus really leaves nowhere for the viewer''s eye to go.</td>', 'I see the failure very well, but I''d like to see a bit different composition.  The depth of field is nice, but centering the focus really leaves nowhere for the viewer''s eye to go.', '2006-05-25 21:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
