(2465546, 337991, 59724, '<td valign="top">A dramatic picture well captured, with good composition, though I find the tiles on the right a bit disturbing, a completely homogenous background would have been better, but nothing serious.<br/>The face is mostly in darkness and just a little light shines on it so we can it a little, this greatly increases the drama if this picture.<br/>I like it very much, good job!</td>', 'A dramatic picture well captured, with good composition, though I find the tiles on the right a bit disturbing, a completely homogenous background would have been better, but nothing serious.The face is mostly in darkness and just a little light shines on it so we can it a little, this greatly increases the drama if this picture.I like it very much, good job!', '2006-05-29 07:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2465550, 337973, 59724, '<td valign="top">Bringing fun into a challenge with a negative title is risky, but you did it very well.</td>', 'Bringing fun into a challenge with a negative title is risky, but you did it very well.', '2006-05-29 07:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2465553, 338219, 59724, '<td valign="top">Umm... how to say this. You don''t have to stand there for eternity. With the title of the challenge we know of course what the picture wants to say, but if you just show it to someone else it won''t say anything.<br/>And the left part of the picture is empty.</td>', 'Umm... how to say this. You don''t have to stand there for eternity. With the title of the challenge we know of course what the picture wants to say, but if you just show it to someone else it won''t say anything.And the left part of the picture is empty.', '2006-05-29 07:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2465555, 337287, 59724, '<td valign="top">The picture looks good but I don''t see any "failure" on it. Of course with the title together everyone knows but I think the picture should be able to stand alone without a title too.</td>', 'The picture looks good but I don''t see any "failure" on it. Of course with the title together everyone knows but I think the picture should be able to stand alone without a title too.', '2006-05-29 07:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2465559, 336645, 59724, '<td valign="top">And again a very good example for good lighting composition. Excellent job.<br/>2 little problems: shadow is cut down a bit on the bottom of the picture, and there from the middle of the picture the white-gray transition is not continous.</td>', 'And again a very good example for good lighting composition. Excellent job.2 little problems: shadow is cut down a bit on the bottom of the picture, and there from the middle of the picture the white-gray transition is not continous.', '2006-05-29 07:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2465560, 337995, 59724, '<td valign="top">No, don''t to this plz. They might be poor but they are not failures. Something else fails but not them basically.<br/>The picture itself is not bad, but don''t put it into this context please.</td>', 'No, don''t to this plz. They might be poor but they are not failures. Something else fails but not them basically.The picture itself is not bad, but don''t put it into this context please.', '2006-05-29 08:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2465564, 337379, 59724, '<td valign="top">Amazing picture. The sky is a bit weird, choose a smaller size instead of reducing the quality too much. A bit more space on the left would have been nice to see those branches too. But overall really amazing picture, good idea!</td>', 'Amazing picture. The sky is a bit weird, choose a smaller size instead of reducing the quality too much. A bit more space on the left would have been nice to see those branches too. But overall really amazing picture, good idea!', '2006-05-29 08:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
