(2465571, 337908, 59724, '<td valign="top">The subject should be a failure not the picture itself I think. You put me into a difficult situation because your picture is beautiful (aside from the dust where a spot healing could help if the site would permit it), but this is not the right challenge for this one.</td>', 'The subject should be a failure not the picture itself I think. You put me into a difficult situation because your picture is beautiful (aside from the dust where a spot healing could help if the site would permit it), but this is not the right challenge for this one.', '2006-05-29 08:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
