(2468290, 338116, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I like the idea.  However the blue hue in this photo isn´t really appealing to me aesthetically, think I would have liked this better in it´s original coloring.  Also I always like shots of fire much better when there is texture in the flames, not blow out like this but this is a nice shot, got a 6 from me.</td>', 'Nice shot, I like the idea.  However the blue hue in this photo isn´t really appealing to me aesthetically, think I would have liked this better in it´s original coloring.  Also I always like shots of fire much better when there is texture in the flames, not blow out like this but this is a nice shot, got a 6 from me.', '2006-05-30 10:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2468293, 337130, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but the image quality is pretty bad here and that is why I gave it a poor rating.  It´s so bad I can´t even make out what I am looking at here.  Sorry, the reason for me to say this is because I make it a rule to explain when I give a low rating.</td>', 'Sorry but the image quality is pretty bad here and that is why I gave it a poor rating.  It´s so bad I can´t even make out what I am looking at here.  Sorry, the reason for me to say this is because I make it a rule to explain when I give a low rating.', '2006-05-30 10:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2468296, 336141, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not a bad take on the challenge, good idea.  Seems WAY to set up though, the darts all very nicely setup together like that, seems to planned and not really convincing at all that someone bad threw them at all since that person could group them so closely and neatly together.</td>', 'Not a bad take on the challenge, good idea.  Seems WAY to set up though, the darts all very nicely setup together like that, seems to planned and not really convincing at all that someone bad threw them at all since that person could group them so closely and neatly together.', '2006-05-30 10:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2468297, 338170, 27482, '<td valign="top">Ed?  You strike again my friend if this is your shot.  If it´s not yours, take this comment as a compliment :)</td>', 'Ed?  You strike again my friend if this is your shot.  If it´s not yours, take this comment as a compliment :)', '2006-05-30 10:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2468311, 336142, 19670, '<td valign="top">I hope the Rubik''s Cube (not Rubix, BTW...) survived! I think this would have been a better composition if the flame wasn''t cut off at the top of the frame.</td>', 'I hope the Rubik''s Cube (not Rubix, BTW...) survived! I think this would have been a better composition if the flame wasn''t cut off at the top of the frame.', '2006-05-30 10:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
