(2468327, 336800, 19670, '<td valign="top">I think the idea here would be better conveyed with the arm in focus and the screen more in the background, or out of focus.</td>', 'I think the idea here would be better conveyed with the arm in focus and the screen more in the background, or out of focus.', '2006-05-30 11:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2468349, 336682, 51538, '<td valign="top">I like the theatre staged here.  Nicely executed.</td>', 'I like the theatre staged here.  Nicely executed.', '2006-05-30 11:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2468350, 338159, 51538, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a little cropping needed - but the image certainly bespeaks the title you selected.  Very nice.</td>', 'Perhaps a little cropping needed - but the image certainly bespeaks the title you selected.  Very nice.', '2006-05-30 11:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2468354, 338255, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice cpture of action and visual metaphor.</td>', 'Nice cpture of action and visual metaphor.', '2006-05-30 11:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2468355, 337793, 51538, '<td valign="top">Indeed, a nicely processed photo.</td>', 'Indeed, a nicely processed photo.', '2006-05-30 11:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2468356, 335706, 24073, '<td valign="top">I am kind of stumped here, I really like the photo, it''s in and of itself a great shot.  It really doesn''t say failure, though I can come up with a thousand reasons why it would.  Looking through the challenge, it seems like it was pretty tuff to get a blatent failure photo, and I don''t want to take away from the people who really nailed it.<br/>    What I really want to say is, this is a great shot, and it might not get what it deserves in this particular challenge.  GL.</td>', 'I am kind of stumped here, I really like the photo, it''s in and of itself a great shot.  It really doesn''t say failure, though I can come up with a thousand reasons why it would.  Looking through the challenge, it seems like it was pretty tuff to get a blatent failure photo, and I don''t want to take away from the people who really nailed it.    What I really want to say is, this is a great shot, and it might not get what it deserves in this particular challenge.  GL.', '2006-05-30 11:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2468357, 338235, 51538, '<td valign="top">Simple but excellent.</td>', 'Simple but excellent.', '2006-05-30 11:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2468359, 336953, 51538, '<td valign="top">Basic but says a lot.</td>', 'Basic but says a lot.', '2006-05-30 11:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2468362, 338116, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nicely executed, if a cliche.  Good work.</td>', 'Nicely executed, if a cliche.  Good work.', '2006-05-30 11:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2468363, 338028, 51538, '<td valign="top">The image says a lot with a little.  It conveys a feeling.  Very good indeed.</td>', 'The image says a lot with a little.  It conveys a feeling.  Very good indeed.', '2006-05-30 11:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2468364, 337971, 51538, '<td valign="top">Clinically clean image.  Nicely executed.</td>', 'Clinically clean image.  Nicely executed.', '2006-05-30 11:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2468368, 338126, 51538, '<td valign="top">The message (as entitled) would have been better conveyed if the boy''s hand was included in the photo about to place the last piece on the tower when the catastrophe happened.</td>', 'The message (as entitled) would have been better conveyed if the boy''s hand was included in the photo about to place the last piece on the tower when the catastrophe happened.', '2006-05-30 11:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2468372, 337981, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured image.</td>', 'Nicely captured image.', '2006-05-30 11:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2468380, 337908, 24073, '<td valign="top">An incredible shot, I am interested to see how it holds up in the "FAILURE" challenge.  Very good shot, it might not get the deserved credit.</td>', 'An incredible shot, I am interested to see how it holds up in the "FAILURE" challenge.  Very good shot, it might not get the deserved credit.', '2006-05-30 11:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
