(2470359, 338294, 37334, '<td valign="top">Well thank god that''s over! I went out with my 70 - 300 lens and nearly had to move back towards Malaysia to fit this much of it into the frame...never again!<br/> <br/>As for '' this would have been good if it were real'' - er...there would be a lot of dead people if it were real.<br/> <br/>Thanks everyone for taking the time to comment -it''s really appreciated;)</td>', 'Well thank god that''s over! I went out with my 70 - 300 lens and nearly had to move back towards Malaysia to fit this much of it into the frame...never again! As for '' this would have been good if it were real'' - er...there would be a lot of dead people if it were real. Thanks everyone for taking the time to comment -it''s really appreciated;)', '2006-05-31 02:32:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2470367, 338335, 33352, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your ribbon,but take away the title wheres the failure,just two pieces of wire making a spark.</td>', 'Congratulations on your ribbon,but take away the title wheres the failure,just two pieces of wire making a spark.', '2006-05-31 02:37:53.000000', NULL, 0),
