(2470406, 338255, 28742, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> A fantastic capture! I am predicting a ribbon. Start celebrating cuz I have almost never been wrong. :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>My record holds! Congratulations!</td>', 'Originally posted by Art Roflmao: A fantastic capture! I am predicting a ribbon. Start celebrating cuz I have almost never been wrong. :)  My record holds! Congratulations!', '2006-05-31 03:00:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2470428, 337885, 20779, '<td valign="top">Wow, new name, new look! This is one of your best ever, Randy.</td>', 'Wow, new name, new look! This is one of your best ever, Randy.', '2006-05-31 03:16:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2470439, 338255, 23430, '<td valign="top">Nice stop action. Crisp focus and the expression says it all. Congrats on another ribbon.</td>', 'Nice stop action. Crisp focus and the expression says it all. Congrats on another ribbon.', '2006-05-31 03:20:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(2470478, 338028, 36141, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the congrats and LOL thanks Rikki for my green ribbon.</td>', 'Thanks for the congrats and LOL thanks Rikki for my green ribbon.', '2006-05-31 03:30:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(2470553, 337991, 36328, '<td valign="top">Excellent! I Gave this a six, quite on the money.<br/> <br/>Great lighting, great feeling goog and comp, and I think it conveys the sentiment well. I agree that more face would show more emotion, and like you I don''t like the tiles on the right, especially as they''re not straight.<br/> <br/>Well done Amanda, you just keep getting better. I''m impressed with you getting a 6+ score in only four attempts (I''ve done 10 enteries and can only manage a 5.7)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Excellent! I Gave this a six, quite on the money. Great lighting, great feeling goog and comp, and I think it conveys the sentiment well. I agree that more face would show more emotion, and like you I don''t like the tiles on the right, especially as they''re not straight. Well done Amanda, you just keep getting better. I''m impressed with you getting a 6+ score in only four attempts (I''ve done 10 enteries and can only manage a 5.7) ', '2006-05-31 03:55:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(2470572, 338123, 31885, '<td valign="top">Wait a minute, this is not a landscape! Like the composition and the contrasting colours and shapes.</td>', 'Wait a minute, this is not a landscape! Like the composition and the contrasting colours and shapes.', '2006-05-31 04:03:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(2470593, 335706, 57229, '<td valign="top">Massive congratulations on yer blue, Blue...</td>', 'Massive congratulations on yer blue, Blue...', '2006-05-31 04:11:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(2470646, 338028, 49109, '<td valign="top">Congrats to your 4th! Mind telling me where that location is?</td>', 'Congrats to your 4th! Mind telling me where that location is?', '2006-05-31 04:35:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(2470762, 337999, 31889, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the top 5 finish but don''t you hate those 4th and 5th place finsihes.  So close and yet so far. :)<br/> <br/>Great submission.<br/> <br/>bazz.</td>', 'Congrats on the top 5 finish but don''t you hate those 4th and 5th place finsihes.  So close and yet so far. :) Great submission. bazz.', '2006-05-31 05:29:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(2470952, 338126, 57358, '<td valign="top">Yeah, this was definitely one of my favorites..  Congratulations on 6th place!!</td>', 'Yeah, this was definitely one of my favorites..  Congratulations on 6th place!!', '2006-05-31 06:38:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(2471037, 335706, 34938, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on a very impacting photo...thoroughly deserved. When you read the story, you realise so many of us complain about silly things...hope you get many more</td>', 'Congratulations on a very impacting photo...thoroughly deserved. When you read the story, you realise so many of us complain about silly things...hope you get many more', '2006-05-31 07:32:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(2471038, 338335, 34938, '<td valign="top">Great shot and congrats on the ribbon...very creative and sharp</td>', 'Great shot and congrats on the ribbon...very creative and sharp', '2006-05-31 07:33:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(2471039, 337841, 52675, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments.', '2006-05-31 07:34:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(2471042, 338255, 34938, '<td valign="top">excellent work as usual from you...this is an excellent sports shot and the look on his face is priceless</td>', 'excellent work as usual from you...this is an excellent sports shot and the look on his face is priceless', '2006-05-31 07:34:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(2471059, 337037, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hey!  I missed this one.  Very nice capture and creative concept.  As a parent I can kind of agree with one of the commenters that it''s freaky, although artistic.  Without a title this could fit in several categories, with the title you''ve tied it into this challenge just fine.<br/> <br/>Compositionally, I think it''s put together very well.  The positioning of the boy in the bottom right thirds quad, and the trees forming a natural intersection, work quite well.  By dropping the green and yellow you''ve really reduced how noisy/busy I''m sure this image was in full color.  <br/> <br/>Someone liked it enough to make it a favorite!  ;^)</td>', 'Hey!  I missed this one.  Very nice capture and creative concept.  As a parent I can kind of agree with one of the commenters that it''s freaky, although artistic.  Without a title this could fit in several categories, with the title you''ve tied it into this challenge just fine. Compositionally, I think it''s put together very well.  The positioning of the boy in the bottom right thirds quad, and the trees forming a natural intersection, work quite well.  By dropping the green and yellow you''ve really reduced how noisy/busy I''m sure this image was in full color.   Someone liked it enough to make it a favorite!  ;^)', '2006-05-31 07:57:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(2471075, 335706, 52549, '<td valign="top">A very powerful and moving photo. Congratulations on your blue ribbon.</td>', 'A very powerful and moving photo. Congratulations on your blue ribbon.', '2006-05-31 08:04:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(2471089, 336953, 34192, '<td valign="top">I scored this high in this challenge.  I like the tones and the DOF.  I thinkit says something, more than many of the others.  Can''t figure out what others didn''t see...</td>', 'I scored this high in this challenge.  I like the tones and the DOF.  I thinkit says something, more than many of the others.  Can''t figure out what others didn''t see...', '2006-05-31 08:09:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(2471092, 338170, 34192, '<td valign="top">I saw this image in the challenge and gave it one of my few high scores.  I find it rather amusing&gt; Its a complete package, something not often easy to find here.</td>', 'I saw this image in the challenge and gave it one of my few high scores.  I find it rather amusing> Its a complete package, something not often easy to find here.', '2006-05-31 08:12:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(2471105, 336478, 7889, '<td valign="top">Well done Amy, great photo and well deserved top 10 finish!<br/> <br/>Mike<br/></td>', 'Well done Amy, great photo and well deserved top 10 finish! Mike', '2006-05-31 08:18:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(2471153, 337267, 52549, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your top 20 finish. Love this picture.</td>', 'Congratulations on your top 20 finish. Love this picture.', '2006-05-31 08:52:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(2471182, 337981, 26633, '<td valign="top">I think the model''s distressed because she''s not going to beat her daughter in a challenge again :)<br/> <br/>Very nice work. I could read into this that the bright colours of the clothing and the landscape represent what is wonderful in the world and then the fact that there is no direct light on the model and the landscape represents the despair, the disappearance or subdual of the light or hope. But maybe I''m just making all that up...</td>', 'I think the model''s distressed because she''s not going to beat her daughter in a challenge again :) Very nice work. I could read into this that the bright colours of the clothing and the landscape represent what is wonderful in the world and then the fact that there is no direct light on the model and the landscape represents the despair, the disappearance or subdual of the light or hope. But maybe I''m just making all that up...', '2006-05-31 09:03:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(2471239, 338241, 49773, '<td valign="top">At least you got 42 comments!</td>', 'At least you got 42 comments!', '2006-05-31 09:28:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(2471245, 337793, 26633, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8. It would have been a 10 but I really don''t like selective desaturation.<br/> <br/>Great subject, composition, lighting and tones. Get rid of the horrible blue and this (in my opinion) would be a fabulous picture.</td>', 'I gave this an 8. It would have been a 10 but I really don''t like selective desaturation. Great subject, composition, lighting and tones. Get rid of the horrible blue and this (in my opinion) would be a fabulous picture.', '2006-05-31 09:30:32.000000', NULL, 0),
