(2471647, 338123, 49326, '<td valign="top">Hey, is that yours? It was one of my favorites. I gave it a ten.</td>', 'Hey, is that yours? It was one of my favorites. I gave it a ten.', '2006-05-31 11:25:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2471665, 337267, 11897, '<td valign="top">If the focus hadn''t let this down a little, would have been a ribbon for sure, great capture nevertheless.</td>', 'If the focus hadn''t let this down a little, would have been a ribbon for sure, great capture nevertheless.', '2006-05-31 11:30:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(2471696, 337981, 37961, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous time of nite to shoot this.</td>', 'Gorgeous time of nite to shoot this.', '2006-05-31 11:37:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(2471751, 337793, 15711, '<td valign="top">Excellent finish. This is a terrific photo and the "blues" rings true twice in this photo - not only with his music, but his jacket.</td>', 'Excellent finish. This is a terrific photo and the "blues" rings true twice in this photo - not only with his music, but his jacket.', '2006-05-31 11:56:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(2471757, 336478, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really well done. I love all of the gray tones.  The compositio is good and this certainly conveys the message.  Congratulations.</td>', 'Really well done. I love all of the gray tones.  The compositio is good and this certainly conveys the message.  Congratulations.', '2006-05-31 11:57:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(2471763, 335706, 15711, '<td valign="top">Isn''t it sad to think that people have to live like this when we have the Donald Trumps of the world??<br/> <br/>This is more than telling.  A great piece of photojournalism, without saying a word.  Congratulations.</td>', 'Isn''t it sad to think that people have to live like this when we have the Donald Trumps of the world?? This is more than telling.  A great piece of photojournalism, without saying a word.  Congratulations.', '2006-05-31 11:58:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(2471768, 337999, 15711, '<td valign="top">Stunning.  The black/gold combination really adds punch. The silhouette is tack sharp and it is something we can all relate to - especially with the excellent title.  Congrats.  This is lovely.</td>', 'Stunning.  The black/gold combination really adds punch. The silhouette is tack sharp and it is something we can all relate to - especially with the excellent title.  Congrats.  This is lovely.', '2006-05-31 11:59:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(2471824, 337934, 42125, '<td valign="top">Again your personal best!<br/>Congratulations on that.<br/><b>CTCP Gunnsi</b> <br/>First impression:<br/>Perfect focus, nice setup, clarity good and good placement of subject.<br/>What can you do better?<br/>Since I have never scored so high, I dunno :-) But I think that you could easily have cut away more of the left.<br/>I am never sure about b/w, In my opinion colour is better and freckels are nice the way they are.</td>', 'Again your personal best!Congratulations on that.CTCP Gunnsi First impression:Perfect focus, nice setup, clarity good and good placement of subject.What can you do better?Since I have never scored so high, I dunno :-) But I think that you could easily have cut away more of the left.I am never sure about b/w, In my opinion colour is better and freckels are nice the way they are.', '2006-05-31 12:13:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(2471893, 338335, 42125, '<td valign="top">You did a great job on this one. The method you used is good.<br/>Congratulations on your ribbon.</td>', 'You did a great job on this one. The method you used is good.Congratulations on your ribbon.', '2006-05-31 12:36:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(2471909, 335706, 42125, '<td valign="top">So the first entry gets the highest votes :-)<br/>Congratulations on you ribbon.<br/>This picture is great and shows so much feelings.</td>', 'So the first entry gets the highest votes :-)Congratulations on you ribbon.This picture is great and shows so much feelings.', '2006-05-31 12:40:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(2472192, 337981, 55642, '<td valign="top">This was my favorite photo of the bunch. Keep up the good work!</td>', 'This was my favorite photo of the bunch. Keep up the good work!', '2006-05-31 13:50:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(2472231, 338306, 59161, '<td valign="top">This was my first challenge and I didn''t really know what I was doing. Yes, my title was terrible and the picture is way too small. I''ll do better with this stuff next time.</td>', 'This was my first challenge and I didn''t really know what I was doing. Yes, my title was terrible and the picture is way too small. I''ll do better with this stuff next time.', '2006-05-31 14:04:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(2472261, 337973, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>   This is funny! Too many grouchy people that don''t have a sense of humor on this site, IMHO. The right arm (on the left) is a little bright. I can just barely see one eye, I think an improvement would have been to see at least all of one eye and maybe some of the other. Other than that, great job!</td>', 'Trading post...   This is funny! Too many grouchy people that don''t have a sense of humor on this site, IMHO. The right arm (on the left) is a little bright. I can just barely see one eye, I think an improvement would have been to see at least all of one eye and maybe some of the other. Other than that, great job!', '2006-05-31 14:16:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2472466, 337991, 16230, '<td valign="top">Nice one Amanda!<br/> <br/>The photo illustrates a powerful story in a simple and graphic way.  That''s a very good thing because what to say and how to say it is often 90% of the battle.  I think you nailed that part down nicely.  Obviously, the highlights are over-exposed, but the high contrast side lighting was a very good choice as it adds drama and complements with the subject.  A bit more work with the lighting might have paid off in a big way.<br/> <br/>Congratulations on making it into the top 20 Amanda!<br/></td>', 'Nice one Amanda! The photo illustrates a powerful story in a simple and graphic way.  That''s a very good thing because what to say and how to say it is often 90% of the battle.  I think you nailed that part down nicely.  Obviously, the highlights are over-exposed, but the high contrast side lighting was a very good choice as it adds drama and complements with the subject.  A bit more work with the lighting might have paid off in a big way. Congratulations on making it into the top 20 Amanda!', '2006-05-31 15:30:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2472472, 337981, 50231, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the Top 10! Awesome work! :-)</td>', 'Congrats on the Top 10! Awesome work! :-)', '2006-05-31 15:31:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2472500, 336953, 27605, '<td valign="top">You trounced me in this challenge, Barry!  Something about this photo seems eerily familiar :&gt;)</td>', 'You trounced me in this challenge, Barry!  Something about this photo seems eerily familiar :>)', '2006-05-31 15:39:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(2472519, 337885, 24454, '<td valign="top">Hey. .great finish Randy!!!   Not as high as it <i>should</i>have been. . .I gave this a 10 and was hoping it would ribbon. . but 12th place is great!  Congratulations!  I LOVE this photo!  It''s so dramatic!<br/> <br/>FANTASTIC JOB!!!!</td>', 'Hey. .great finish Randy!!!   Not as high as it shouldhave been. . .I gave this a 10 and was hoping it would ribbon. . but 12th place is great!  Congratulations!  I LOVE this photo!  It''s so dramatic! FANTASTIC JOB!!!!', '2006-05-31 15:48:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(2472662, 338126, 38127, '<td valign="top">Hey nice finish.. congrats on your top ten placement :)</td>', 'Hey nice finish.. congrats on your top ten placement :)', '2006-05-31 16:23:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2473258, 338256, 46466, '<td valign="top">This should have scored higher. I don''t really stick with my last comment, which I now find kind of cruel, but still funny.</td>', 'This should have scored higher. I don''t really stick with my last comment, which I now find kind of cruel, but still funny.', '2006-05-31 19:00:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(2474313, 337934, 55642, '<td valign="top">Wow, Margie, you''re on a roll! I really don''t have too much to suggest for this since it''s a very good shot. Maybe a couple small hot spots on her nose, but that''s it. Congratulations!</td>', 'Wow, Margie, you''re on a roll! I really don''t have too much to suggest for this since it''s a very good shot. Maybe a couple small hot spots on her nose, but that''s it. Congratulations!', '2006-05-31 23:15:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2474524, 337991, 33352, '<td valign="top">Cangratulations Amanda, thought this would have finished higher as it was perfect for the challenge.</td>', 'Cangratulations Amanda, thought this would have finished higher as it was perfect for the challenge.', '2006-06-01 00:06:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(2474601, 336478, 5885, '<td valign="top">Love this shot!</td>', 'Love this shot!', '2006-06-01 00:27:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(2474641, 337973, 30982, '<td valign="top">Trading Post comment<br/>Heh!  This is pretty good!  Only immediate improvement in "context" is to show the screen with the DPC page up - relies on title too much otherwise.  Composition is not bad but the blinds in the background seem to draw my eye away from the subject.  The baghead part is too darn funny - voters need to work on their sense of humor just a bit.<br/> <br/>Edit to add - after reading Kelli''s comments, yes, it would be nice to see an eye a bit clearer.</td>', 'Trading Post commentHeh!  This is pretty good!  Only immediate improvement in "context" is to show the screen with the DPC page up - relies on title too much otherwise.  Composition is not bad but the blinds in the background seem to draw my eye away from the subject.  The baghead part is too darn funny - voters need to work on their sense of humor just a bit. Edit to add - after reading Kelli''s comments, yes, it would be nice to see an eye a bit clearer.', '2006-06-01 00:38:12.000000', NULL, 0),
