(2484924, 336478, 43434, '<td valign="top"><br/><b><i>::: Critique Club :::</i></b> <br/> <br/>Hi, my name is Kari and from the critique club.<br/> <br/><b>First Impression - the most important one:</b> <br/>Top ten .. congrats, well done and all that ... now a few comments.  first impression is this is gritty and realistic.<br/> <br/><b>Composition:</b> <br/>I really like this and feel that you have worked things through to bring the best from this shot.<br/> <br/><b>Subject:</b> <br/>You met the challenge and did so extremely well.<br/> <br/><b>Technical (Colour and light):</b> <br/>This is the issues part.  I think that a little less post processing and use of neat image and you would have really challenged for the blue.  That is the only issue with this picture and i think that would have lost you minor but valuable points.<br/> <br/><b>To grow its vote?:</b> <br/>As above ... but really you did fantastic.<br/> <br/><b>Summary:</b> <br/>Great job, congrats.<br/> <br/>If you''ve got any questions about this critique, please feel free to contact me via<br/>the PM system.<br/> <br/>Cheers<br/> <br/>Kari</td>', '::: Critique Club :::  Hi, my name is Kari and from the critique club. First Impression - the most important one: Top ten .. congrats, well done and all that ... now a few comments.  first impression is this is gritty and realistic. Composition: I really like this and feel that you have worked things through to bring the best from this shot. Subject: You met the challenge and did so extremely well. Technical (Colour and light): This is the issues part.  I think that a little less post processing and use of neat image and you would have really challenged for the blue.  That is the only issue with this picture and i think that would have lost you minor but valuable points. To grow its vote?: As above ... but really you did fantastic. Summary: Great job, congrats. If you''ve got any questions about this critique, please feel free to contact me viathe PM system. Cheers Kari', '2006-06-05 01:20:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2485133, 337870, 58634, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this picture. <br/>But I think you could''ve used a different angle. <br/>And more blood to impact more. <br/>Also, shown more of the hand. <br/>And also focused a bit better. <br/>Im guessing you took a pic of yourself so it made it harder for you to focus or something. <br/> <br/>Oh and definately a different title. <br/>Better luck next time.</td>', 'I like the idea of this picture. But I think you could''ve used a different angle. And more blood to impact more. Also, shown more of the hand. And also focused a bit better. Im guessing you took a pic of yourself so it made it harder for you to focus or something.  Oh and definately a different title. Better luck next time.', '2006-06-05 02:05:54.000000', NULL, 0),
