(2509910, 337919, 8891, '<td valign="top">This definitely should have rated higher and I guess it sort shows how you might be feeling about now. A break may be best....Of course whenever I get down, I find something to shoot and then I feel better. Then I enter into a challenge and...well you know...and then I feel down again and I shoot again....it''s a very vicious circle. I think I might take you up on the break thing....after  WPL2...maybe, if I can last til then. Hope your break cures your woes and come back soon.</td>', 'This definitely should have rated higher and I guess it sort shows how you might be feeling about now. A break may be best....Of course whenever I get down, I find something to shoot and then I feel better. Then I enter into a challenge and...well you know...and then I feel down again and I shoot again....it''s a very vicious circle. I think I might take you up on the break thing....after  WPL2...maybe, if I can last til then. Hope your break cures your woes and come back soon.', '2006-06-12 16:47:35.000000', NULL, 0),
