(2549020, 337934, 30454, '<td valign="top">Greetings from your own critique club.<br/> <br/><b>First Impression</b> <br/>Very Nice emotive shot. Reading your comments, looks like she has better career in acting. <br/><b>Composition:</b> <br/>Just perfect.<br/><b>Subject:</b> <br/>Nice take on the challenge.<br/><b>Technical (Colour and light):</b> <br/>The color and lighting are spot on. B&amp;W is the perfect choice.<br/><b>Improvement:</b> <br/>Nothing much really. If I have to be picky, I would say she is looking outside the frame. At least one of these object in the left side like letter, flower or ring would have made it a story.<br/><b>Summary:</b> <br/>Very nice emotive image, perfect for the challenge.<br/> <br/>Congrates on your Personal Best and top 20(almost top 10). Cheers!!!</td>', 'Greetings from your own critique club. First Impression Very Nice emotive shot. Reading your comments, looks like she has better career in acting. Composition: Just perfect.Subject: Nice take on the challenge.Technical (Colour and light): The color and lighting are spot on. B&W is the perfect choice.Improvement: Nothing much really. If I have to be picky, I would say she is looking outside the frame. At least one of these object in the left side like letter, flower or ring would have made it a story.Summary: Very nice emotive image, perfect for the challenge. Congrates on your Personal Best and top 20(almost top 10). Cheers!!!', '2006-06-24 16:42:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(2582184, 335706, 61261, '<td valign="top">bro, this capture is overflowing with raw emotion. i was browsing your portfolio and this photo caught my attention. a great capture of a pure, 100% real moment!<br/> <br/>kudos!</td>', 'bro, this capture is overflowing with raw emotion. i was browsing your portfolio and this photo caught my attention. a great capture of a pure, 100% real moment! kudos!', '2006-07-04 03:56:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(2597629, 338123, 60799, '<td valign="top">Your colors and texture in this image are superb.  I like how you''ve taken a very simple subject and presented it in a clear and uncluttered manner... I need to work on that myself.</td>', 'Your colors and texture in this image are superb.  I like how you''ve taken a very simple subject and presented it in a clear and uncluttered manner... I need to work on that myself.', '2006-07-07 14:39:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(2624002, 337991, 60862, '<td valign="top">This is a powerful shot.  I actually prefer this one to the edited version.  It''s somehow more emotional - it says "raw response" to me more than the other one.<br/> <br/>Okay, you could get rid of the spot on her right.  But I prefer the angled tiles to be visible.<br/> <br/>I really like how you left it open to interpretation!</td>', 'This is a powerful shot.  I actually prefer this one to the edited version.  It''s somehow more emotional - it says "raw response" to me more than the other one. Okay, you could get rid of the spot on her right.  But I prefer the angled tiles to be visible. I really like how you left it open to interpretation!', '2006-07-15 01:11:00.000000', NULL, 0),
